e same plans and site limits.'=>'Àpapọ̀ náà kò náwó púpọ̀ bíi ríra àwọn àfikún méjèèjì lọ́tọ̀ọ̀tọ̀, lórí àwọn ètò àti àwọn ààlà ojúlé kan náà.','See the bundle'=>'Wo àpapọ̀ náà','Get %s'=>'Gba %s','Integration active: %1$s and %2$s work together'=>'Ìsopọ̀ ń ṣiṣẹ́: %1$s àti %2$s ń ṣiṣẹ́ papọ̀','%s is active on this site, so both plugins share one set of AI provider keys and one settings screen for them.'=>'%s n ṣiṣẹ lori aaye yii, nitorinaa awọn afikun mejeeji pin eto kan ti awọn bọtini olupese AI ati oju-iboju eto kan fun wọn.','Translate this site with Tranzly'=>'Túmọ̀ ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí pẹ̀lú Tranzly','Build pages visually with Page Builder Sandwich'=>'Kọ àwọn ojú-ìwé lójúfò pẹ̀lú Page Builder Sandwich','%s, from Zinn Digital®'=>'%s, láti Zinn Digital®','Publish every page in many languages, with translated addresses, SEO data and a language switcher. Works with the pages you build here.'=>'Ṣe atẹjade gbogbo oju-iwe ni ọpọlọpọ awọn ede, pẹlu awọn adirẹsi ti a tumọ, data SEO ati oluyipada ede. O n ṣiṣẹ pẹlu awọn oju-iwe ti o kọ nibi.','Design pages right in the editor with fast, footprint-free blocks. Everything you build translates with Tranzly.'=>'Ṣe àgbékalẹ̀ àwọn ojú-ewé taara nínú olóòtú pẹ̀lú àwọn bulọ́ọ̀kì tó yára tí kò sì ní footprint. Ohun gbogbo tí ẹ bá kọ́ ló ń ṣe ìyípadà èdè pẹ̀lú Tranzly.','%s is made by the same team and works alongside this plugin.'=>'Ẹgbẹ́ kan náà ló ṣe %s, ó sì ń ṣiṣẹ́ pẹ̀lú àfikún yìí.','Agree to connecting this site first.'=>'Gba láti so ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí pọ̀ kọ́kọ́.','Enter a valid e-mail address.'=>'Tẹ àdírẹ́sì e-mail tó tọ́ sii.','Agree to sending support information first.'=>'Gba lati fi àwọn ìsọfúnni ìrànlọ́wọ́ ránṣẹ́ ná kọ́.','Write a subject and a message.'=>'Kọ orí-ọ̀rọ̀ àti ìránṣẹ́ kan.','Enter an e-mail address support can reply to.'=>'Tẹ àdírẹ́ẹ̀sì e-mail tí àtìlẹ́yìn lè fèsì sí sínú rẹ̀.','AI providers'=>'Àwọn olùpèsè AI','The makers of ChatGPT. A good all-rounder.'=>'Àwọn olùṣẹ̀dá ChatGPT. Ohun tó dára fún gbogbo nǹkan.','The makers of Claude. Strong at writing and careful reasoning.'=>'Àwọn olùṣẹ̀dá Claude. Ó tayọ nínú kíkọ̀wé àti ìfòye pẹ̀lú ìṣọ́ra.','Google\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Àwọn àwòṣe Gemini ti Google. Ó yára, kò sì gbówó lórí.','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'Ilé-iṣẹ́ AI ti Yúróòpù kan tó ní àwọn àwòṣe tó yára tí kò sì wọ́n.','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'Àwọn àpẹẹrẹ olówó pọ́ọ́kú tí ó dára nínú kíkọ àti koodu.','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'Kọ́kọ́rọ́ kan fún àwọn àwòṣe láti ọ̀dọ̀ ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ àwọn olùpèsè ọ̀tọ̀ọ̀tọ̀.','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'Iṣẹ́ èyíkéyìí tí ó ń ṣiṣẹ́ bíi API ti OpenAI, pẹ̀lú àwòṣe tí ń ṣiṣẹ́ lórí kọ̀ǹpútà tàbí ẹ̀rọ-ìpèsè tirẹ̀.','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'Gbogbogbò (a máa ń lò ó nígbà tí a kò bá yan ohun pàtó mìíràn)','Writing and rewriting'=>'Kíkọ àti àkọtún','Translation'=>'Ìtumọ̀','Code and CSS'=>'Koodu àti CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'Ẹ má bínú, a kò gbà yín láàyè láti wọ ojú-ewé yìí.','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'Awọn eto wọnyi jẹ pinpin nipasẹ gbogbo afikun ti o nlo wọn: %s.','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'Àwọn kókó rẹ jẹ́ mímú lẹ́sẹkẹsẹ nínú àkójọ-ìpìlẹ̀ data ti ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí, wọ́n sì máa ń rán wọn sí olùpèsè tí o yàn nìkan — kì í ṣe sí wa rárá.','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'Igbese 1 ninu 2: yan olupese AI kan','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'O n mu kọkọrọ tirẹ wa, nitorinaa o sanwo taara fun olupese fun ohun ti o lo. Kò dá ọ lójú? Eyikeyi ninu iwọnyi n ṣiṣẹ daradara; o le ṣafikun diẹ sii nigbamii.','Next'=>'Tókàn','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'Igbese 2 ninu 2: so %s pọ','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'Tẹ adirẹsi ti iṣẹ rẹ ti o ba OpenAI mu, ti o pari pẹlu /v1. Kọkọrọ kan nilo ti iṣẹ naa ba beere fun ọkan nikan.','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'Ṣí %s kí o sì wọlé (tàbí ṣẹ̀dá àkọọ́lẹ̀ ọ̀fẹ́ kan).','the %s API keys page'=>'ojú-ìwé àwọn kókórọ́ API %s','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'Ṣẹ̀dá kọ́kọ́rọ́ tuntun kan kí o sì da ẹ̀kọfìn rẹ̀ kọ.','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'Lẹ ẹ si isalẹ ki o tẹ "Fipamọ ati idanwo". A nfi ibeere kekere kan ranṣẹ lati ṣayẹwo boya o n ṣiṣẹ.','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'Ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ àwọn olùpèsè ló nílò owó díẹ̀ lórí àkópọ̀-owó kí kọ́kọ́rọ́ kan tó lè ṣiṣẹ́: %s.','add credit'=>'Fi kírẹ́dììtì kún un','← Choose a different provider'=>'← Yan olupese miiran','Address'=>'Àdírẹ́ẹ̀sì','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'Kókó tí a fipamọ́ parí sí …%s — lẹ̀ tuntun kan láti rọ́pò rẹ̀','Key (optional)'=>'Kókó (tí kò pọn dandan)','API key'=>'Kóòdù API','Save and test'=>'Fipamọ́ kí o sì dán an wò','Providers'=>'Àwọn olùpèsè','Provider'=>'Olupese','Status'=>'Ipò','Key'=>'Kókó','Get a key'=>'Gba kọ́kọ́rọ́ kan','Test'=>'Idanwo','Remove'=>'Yọkúrò','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'Fipamọ nipasẹ ẹya afikun ti o titun ju: ṣe imudojuiwọn afikun yii, tabi tẹ bọtini naa sii lẹẹkansi.','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Kò le ṣe é ṣe mọ́ láti ṣí kọ́kọ́rọ́ tí a fi pamọ́ (àwọn kọ́kọ́rọ́ ààbò ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù ti yípadà). Tún un tẹ̀ wọlé.','Not connected'=>'A ko sopọ','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'Ti so pọ — idanwo to kẹhin kọja %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'Ìdánwò tó gbẹ̀yìn kùnà: %s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'Ti sopọ — a ko tii danwo','Which model to use'=>'Awoṣe wo lati lo','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ ṣe afihan iṣeduro wa fun iṣẹ yẹn. Atokọ naa pẹlu gbogbo awoṣe ti kọkọrọ rẹ le lo, ti a ka taara lati ọdọ olupese.','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— A gbaniyanju fun olùpèsè —','Save models'=>'Fi àwọn àwòṣe pamọ́','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'Sọ awọn akojọ awoṣe di tuntun lati ọdọ awọn olupese','Images'=>'Àwọn àwòrán','Connect OpenAI or Google Gemini to make images.'=>'So OpenAI tàbí Google Gemini pọ̀ láti ṣẹ̀dá àwọn àwòrán.','— The newest image model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Àwòṣe àwòrán tuntun jùlọ ti olupese ti a ti sopọ akọkọ —','Site search (embeddings)'=>'Ìwárí ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù (àwọn ìfikún)','Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter to build a search index of your site.'=>'So Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral tabi OpenRouter pọ lati kọ atọka wiwa ti aaye rẹ.','— The newest embedding model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Àwòṣe ìfìkún tuntun jùlọ ti olupese àkọ́kọ́ tí a so pọ̀ —','Changing this rebuilds the search index of every plugin that uses it.'=>'Yiyipada eyi yoo tun itọka wiwa ti gbogbo ohun-afikun ti o nlo o kọ.','best quality'=>'Didara to dara julọ','lowest cost'=>'Iye tí ó kéré jù','fastest'=>'Tó yára jùlọ','Add a model yourself'=>'Fi àwòṣe kún fúnrarẹ','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'Ṣe àwòṣe kan jáde lónìí? Lẹ orúkọ rẹ̀ gan-an mọ́ ọn láti lò ó lẹ́sẹ̀kẹsẹ̀.','Model name'=>'Orukọ àwòṣe','Add model'=>'Ṣafikun àwòṣe','Recommended models list'=>'Àtòjọ àwọn àwòṣe tí a dámọ̀ràn','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'A ko le ṣe idaniloju akojọ awọn awoṣe ti a ṣe iṣeduro, nitorina ko si awọn iṣeduro ti a fihan. Tun itanna naa fi sii, tabi tan awọn imudojuiwọn ojoojumọ ni isalẹ.','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'Akojọ ti a nlo ni a tẹjade ni %s. Imudojuiwọn itanna kọọkan n mu tuntun wa.','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'Tun ṣayẹwo Zinn Digital® lẹẹkan lojumọ fun atokọ ti a ti sọtun.','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'Ìbéèrè ìgbàsílẹ̀ lásán nìkan ni a fi ránṣẹ́: kò sí kókó, kò sí àdírẹ́sì ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù, kò sí nǹkankan nípa àkóónú yín. A buwọ́lu àtòjọ náà, a sì máa fojú kéré àtòjọ tí kò bá yege àyẹ̀wò ìbọwọ́lù náà.','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'A yẹwo rẹ kẹhin %1$s: %2$s.','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'Fipamọ́, kí o sì yẹ̀ ẹ́ wò báyìí bí ó bá wa ni titan','a newer list was installed'=>'A ti fi àtòjọ tuntun sípò','already up to date'=>'ti wa ni imudojuiwọn tẹlẹ','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'Gbigbasilẹ naa kuna ayẹwo ifọwọsi ati pe a kọ ọ silẹ','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'A kò lè kàn sí Zinn Digital®; àkójọ orúkọ lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́ ṣì wà ní lílò','turned off'=>'ti wa ni pipa','Open'=>'Ṣí','Check their status page'=>'Wo oju-iwe ipo wọn','Open your billing page'=>'Ṣí ojú-ìwé ìsanwó rẹ','Open your API keys page'=>'Ṣí ojú-ewé àwọn kọ́kọ́rọ́ API rẹ','Open the AI settings'=>'Ṣí àwọn ètò AI','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Ẹ má bínú, a kò yọ̀ọ̀da fún yín láti ṣe bẹ́ẹ̀.','Unknown provider.'=>'Olupese ti a ko mọ.','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'Tẹ adirẹsi iṣẹ rẹ sii, fun apẹẹrẹ http://localhost:11434/v1.','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'Iyẹn ko dabi kọkọrọ API. Daakọ rẹ lẹẹkansi, laisi awọn aaye.','Paste your API key first.'=>'Kọ́kọ́ lẹ kókó API rẹ síbí.','Key removed.'=>'A ti yọ kọ́kọ́rọ́ kúrò.','Models saved.'=>'A ti fi àwọn àwòṣe pamọ́.','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'Tẹ orukọ gangan ti awoṣe naa sii, fun apẹẹrẹ bi iwe afọwọkọ ti olupese ṣe kọ ọ.','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'A ti fi %s kún un. Yàn án lábẹ́ "Àwòṣe wo ni kí a lò".','Model removed.'=>'A ti yọ àwòṣe kúrò.','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'A ti pa àwọn ìmúdàgbàsókè ojoojúmọ́. Àtòjọ tí ó wá pẹ̀lú àfikún náà ni a ń lò.','Checked: %s.'=>'A ti yẹẹwo: %s.','Model lists refreshed.'=>'A ti sọ awọn akojọ awoṣe di tuntun.','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'Ẹ̀yà tuntun ti ọ̀kan nínú àwọn àfikún rẹ ti fi kọ́kọ́rọ́ AI rẹ pamọ́. Ṣe àfikún yìí di tuntun, tàbí tún kọ́kọ́rọ́ náà tẹ̀ sí inú àwọn ètò AI.','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'Kóókù AI rẹ tí a fi pamọ́ kò le ṣe é ṣí mọ́ (àwọn kóókù ààbò ti ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù ti yípadà). Tún tẹ̀ ẹ́ sí inú àwọn ètò AI.','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'A kò tíì ṣètò AI. Fi kókó kọ́kọ́rọ́ kún un fún olùpèsè AI nínú àwọn ètò AI.','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'A kò yan àwòṣe kankan fún iṣẹ́ yìí. Yan ọ̀kan nínú àwọn ètò AI.','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'Olupese AI yẹn ko ni atilẹyin nipasẹ ẹya afikun yii.','No AI provider that can make images is connected. Add an OpenAI or Google Gemini key in the AI settings.'=>'Ko si olupese AI ti o le ṣẹda awọn aworan ti o sopọ. Ṣafikun kọkọrọ OpenAI tabi Google Gemini ninu awọn eto AI.','This AI provider cannot make images. Choose OpenAI or Google Gemini for images in the AI settings.'=>'Olupese AI yii ko le ṣe awọn aworan. Yan OpenAI tabi Google Gemini fun awọn aworan ninu awọn eto AI.','Your AI key cannot use any image model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for images.'=>'Kọkọrọ AI rẹ ko le lo awoṣe aworan eyikeyi. Ṣayẹwo awọn igbanilaaye kọkọrọ naa pẹlu olupese, tabi yan olupese miiran fun awọn aworan.','No connected AI provider can build a search index. Add a Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter key in the AI settings.'=>'Ko si olupese AI ti a sopọ ti o le kọ atọka wiwa. Ṣafikun kọkọrọ Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral tabi OpenRouter ninu awọn eto AI.','Your AI key cannot use any embedding model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for site search.'=>'Kókó AI rẹ kò le lo àwòṣe ìtẹ̀bọ̀ (embedding) kankan. Ṣàyẹ̀wò àwọn àṣẹ kókó náà pẹ̀lú olùpèsè, tàbí yan olùpèsè mìíràn fún àwárí ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù náà.','This AI provider cannot build a search index. Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or a compatible service for site search.'=>'Olupese AI yii ko le kọ atọka wiwa. So Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral tabi iṣẹ ti o baamu pọ fun wiwa aaye.','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'Aaye yii ko le sopọ mọ iṣẹ AI rẹ. Ṣayẹwo pe o n ṣiṣẹ ati pe adirẹsi rẹ le wọle lati ọdọ olupin ayelujara rẹ (iṣẹ kan lori kọmputa ti ara rẹ ko le wọle lati aaye ti a gbalejo).','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'Aaye yii ko le de %s. Ṣayẹwo oju-iwe ipo wọn; ti wọn ba n ṣiṣẹ, agbalejo rẹ le ma ṣe idiwọ awọn asopọ ti njade, tabi adirẹsi naa ko tọ.','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s sọ pe akọọlẹ rẹ ko ni kirediti tabi ipin kankan to ku. Ṣafikun kirediti tabi gbe opin rẹ ga ninu akọọlẹ rẹ pẹlu wọn, lẹhinna tun gbiyanju lẹẹkansi.','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s kò gba kọ́kọ́rọ́ rẹ. Ó lè jẹ́ pé a tẹ̀ ẹ́ lọ́nà tí kò tọ́, a ti fagilé e tàbí ó ti parí. Ṣẹ̀dá kọ́kọ́rọ́ tuntun kan kí o sì lẹ̀ mọ́ ibi.','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s kọ ibeere yii fun kọkọrọ rẹ. Kọkọrọ naa le ma ni iwọle si awoṣe tabi ẹya ara ẹrọ yii, tabi akọọlẹ rẹ nilo ijẹrisi.','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'Awoṣe "%1$s" ko si lati %2$s fun kọ́kọ́rọ́ rẹ. Yan awoṣe miiran ninu awọn eto AI.','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'Ètò %2$s rẹ kò pẹ̀lú àwòṣe "%1$s". Yan àwòṣe mìíràn nínú àwọn ètò AI, tàbí gbé ètò rẹ ga pẹ̀lú wọn.','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s n dinku bawo ni kokoro re se le yara fi awon ibeere ranse to. Duro fun iseju kan ki o tun gbiyanju, tabi gbe opin oṣuwon re ga pelu won.','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s n doju kọ awọn iṣoro lọwọlọwọ (idilọwọ tabi ikojọpọ pupọ ni ẹgbẹ wọn). Ko si ohun ti o buru pẹlu awọn eto rẹ. Gbiyanju lẹẹkansi laipẹ.','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'Ìbéèrè AI náà kùnà fún ìdí tí a kò lè mọ̀. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i; bí ó bá ń tẹ̀síwájú, kàn sí àtìlẹ́yìn pẹ̀lú àwọn kúlẹ̀kúlẹ̀ tí ó wà nísàlẹ̀ yìí.','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'Olupese AI naa dahun ni ọna ti afikun yii ko le ka. Tun gbiyanju lẹẹkansi; ti o ba n tẹsiwaju, yan awoṣe miiran tabi kan si atilẹyin.','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'Aṣaṣe (ibaramu pẹlu OpenAI)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'Kọ́kọ́ fi kọ́kọ́rọ́ pamọ́ fún olùpèsè yìí.','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'Kọ́kọ́rọ́ rẹ ń ṣiṣẹ́, ṣùgbọ́n olùpèsè náà kò to àwòṣe ọ̀rọ̀ kankan fún un. Fi àwòṣe kún fúnra rẹ ní ìsàlẹ̀.','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'Ti sopọ. %1$s dahun nipa lilo %2$s. Awọn ẹya AI rẹ ti ṣetan lati lo.','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Ipa olumulo rẹ ko gba laaye lati lo AI lori aaye yii. Beere lọwọ alabojuto kan.','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Aaye yii ti de opin inawo AI oṣooṣu rẹ. Alakoso le gbe e ga ninu awọn eto AI.','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Aaye yii ti de opin oṣooṣu ti awọn ibeere AI rẹ. Olutọju le mu u pọ si ninu awọn eto AI.','Usage and cost'=>'Lilo ati iye owo','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'Àkọsílẹ̀, àwọn ààlà àti àwọn àṣẹ ipa kan AI tí a lò nípasẹ̀: %s.','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'Àwọn owó jẹ́ ti ìfojúsùn, tí a ṣírò láti inú àwọn iye owó tí a tẹ̀jáde; àwòṣe tí kò ní iye owó tí a mọ̀ ni a kà sí oókan.','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'Oṣù yìí: àwọn ìbéèrè %1$s, nǹkan bí %2$s.','When'=>'Nigbawo','Who'=>'Ta ni','Used for'=>'A lò fún','Model'=>'Awoṣe','Tokens in / out'=>'Àwọn tókẹ̀nì wọlé / jáde','About'=>'Nípa','Result'=>'Èsì','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'A kò tíì ṣe àwọn ìbéèrè AI kankan.','Done'=>'Ti ṣe tán','Limits and permissions'=>'Àwọn ààlà àti àwọn àṣẹ','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'Iwọn inawo oṣooṣu (dola US)','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'Fi sílẹ̀ ní òfo fún àìníwọ̀n. AI máa dáwọ́ dúró fún ìyókù oṣù náà ní kété tí iye owó tí a fojúbù bá dé ibẹ̀.','Monthly request limit'=>'Ìwọ̀n àbá oṣooṣù','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'Fi silẹ ni ofo fun laisi idiwọn.','Who may use AI'=>'Tani ó lè lo AI','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'Ma ṣe yan eyikeyi lati gba gbogbo eniyan ti o le lo awọn ẹya itanna laaye lati lo AI. Awọn alabojuto le lo nigbagbogbo.','Save limits and permissions'=>'Fipamọ́ àwọn ààlà àti àwọn àṣẹ','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'A ti fi àwọn ààlà àti àwọn àṣẹ pamọ́.','That language is not one of this site\'s languages.'=>'Èdè yẹn kì í ṣe ọ̀kan nínú àwọn èdè ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí.','A translation must be the same kind of content as the original.'=>'Itumọ gbọdọ jẹ iru akoonu kanna gẹgẹbi ti atilẹba.','Choose one of the site\'s other languages.'=>'Yan ọkan ninu awọn ede miiran ti aaye naa.','The admin screen\'s scripts are missing from this copy of the plugin. Reinstall it from a released package.'=>'Àwọn ìwé àkọsílẹ̀ ojú-iboju alábòójútó kù nínú àwòkọ afikun yí. Tún fi sii láti inú àkójọpọ tí a ti se ìtúsílẹ̀ rẹ̀.','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'Ojú-ìwòye yìí nílò JavaScript.','Choose a language'=>'Yan èdè kan','Hosting customer? Get %1$d%% off %2$s'=>'Oniba alejo gbigba? Gba ẹdinwo %1$d%% lori %2$s','As a Zinn Digital® hosting customer you get a personal code for %d%% off your first payment. Renewals are at the normal price.'=>'Gẹ́gẹ́ bí oníbàárà ìgbàlejò Zinn Digital®, o gba kóòdù àkànṣe fún ẹ̀dínwó %d%% lórí ìsanwó àkọ́kọ́ rẹ. Àwọn ìsọdọ̀tun wà ní iye owó tẹ́lẹ̀.','Get my %d%% code and go to checkout'=>'Gba koodu %d%% mi ki o lọ si isanwo','This discount is for customers with a paid hosting plan in good standing. Free trials do not qualify.'=>'Ẹdinwo yii wa fun awọn onibara ti o ni eto gbigbalejo ti a sanwo fun ti o wa ni ipo to dara. Awọn idanwo ọfẹ ko yẹ.','You have already used your hosting-customer discount for this plugin.'=>'O ti lo ẹdinwo alabara alejo gbigba rẹ tẹlẹ fun itanna yii.','We could not get your code just now. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'A kò le gba koodu rẹ ni bayi. Jọwọ gbiyanju lẹẹkansi ni iṣẹju diẹ.','The prefix must be 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, start with a letter, and must not name the plugin.'=>'Àfipwájú gbọ́dọ̀ jẹ́ lẹ́tà kékeré tàbí nọ́mbà 1 sí 8, bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú lẹ́tà kan, kò sì gbọ́dọ̀ pe orúkọ àfikún náà.','"%s" is not a language code. Use a WordPress locale such as fr_FR or de_DE.'=>'"%s" kò kọ́dù èdè. Lo èdè WordPress bíi fr_FR tàbí de_DE.','List at least one language.'=>'Ṣe àkójọ ó kéré tán èdè kan.','Translations'=>'Àwọn Ìtumọ̀','Edit the %s version'=>'Ṣàtúnṣe ẹ̀dà %s náà','Compare the %s version side by side'=>'Ṣe afiwe ẹya %s lẹgbẹẹgbẹ','%1$s (%2$s)'=>'%1$s (%2$s)','Alternative text'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ àfikún','Caption'=>'Àkọlé','Title'=>'Àkọlé','Choose one of your menus for each language.'=>'Yan ọkan ninu awọn akojọ aṣayan rẹ fun ede kọọkan.','Save this post first, then translate it here.'=>'Kọ́kọ́ fi àkọsílẹ̀ yìí pamọ́, lẹ́yìn náà kí o túmọ̀ rẹ̀ níhìn-ín.','This one'=>'Èyí','Edit'=>'Ṣàtúnṣe','Side by side'=>'Lẹgbẹẹgbẹ́','Translate again'=>'Túmọ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi','Translate'=>'Ṣe itumọ','Create a copy to translate by hand'=>'Ṣẹda ẹda kan lati ṣe itumọ pẹlu ọwọ','Translate uses the engine set for that language. A version a person edited is never overwritten.'=>'Ìyípadà èdè ń lo ẹ̀rọ tí a ṣètò fún èdè yẹn. Àtúnṣe tí ènìyàn ṣe kò ní kọlu láéláé.','You are not allowed to translate this item.'=>'A kò gba ọ́ láàyè láti túmọ̀ ohun yìí.','%s: translated.'=>'%s: ti túmọ̀.','This is not a translation, so there is nothing to protect.'=>'Eyi kii ṣe itumọ, nitorina ko si ohun ti a le daabobo.','This kind of content is not translated.'=>'Irú àkóónú yìí kì í ṣe ìtumọ̀.','Text %s is not on this site any more. Reload the page.'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ %s kò sí lórí ojúlé yìí mọ́. Tún ojú-ewé náà gbé wọlé.','Choose one of your other languages.'=>'Yan ọkan ninu awọn ede rẹ miiran.','Compare translation'=>'Ṣe afiwe itumọ','You are not allowed to edit this translation.'=>'A ko gba ọ laaye lati ṣatunkọ itumọ yii.','This piece now contains formatting. Reload the page to edit it.'=>'Apá yìí ní ìgbékalẹ̀ báyìí. Tún ojú-ewé náà gbé wọlé láti ṣàtúnṣe rẹ̀.','This is not a translation, so there is nothing to compare.'=>'Èyí kì í ṣe ìyípadà èdè, nítorí náà kò sí ohun tí a lè fi wé e.','The original of this translation no longer exists.'=>'Àtìbẹ̀rẹ̀ ìtumọ̀ yìí kò sí mọ́.','Piece %s is not part of this translation any more. Reload the page and try again.'=>'Abala %s kò sí nínú ìyípadà èdè yìí mọ́. Tún ojú-ewé náà gbé wọlé kí o sì gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi.','Translate on this page'=>'Ṣe itumọ lori oju-iwe yii','This item already has a version in that language.'=>'Nkan yii ti ni ẹya kan tẹlẹ ni ede yẹn.','That translation engine is not available on this site.'=>'Ẹrọ ìtúmọ̀ yẹn kò sí lórí ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí.','Different engines and AI models per language, automatic fallback and spending caps are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'Awọn ẹrọ ati awọn awoṣe AI ti o yatọ fun ede kọọkan, ifasẹyin laifọwọyi ati awọn opin inawo jẹ awọn ẹya ara ẹrọ Tranzly Pro.','Preferred translations and tone per language are Tranzly Pro features. The do-not-translate list is free.'=>'Awọn itumọ ti a fẹran ati ohun orin fun ede kọọkan jẹ awọn ẹya ara ẹrọ Tranzly Pro. Atokọ ma-ṣe-tumọ jẹ ọfẹ.','The value for %s is not one of the allowed choices.'=>'Iye fún %s kì í ṣe ọ̀kan lára ​​àwọn àṣàyàn tí a gbà láyè.','The background queue is not available on this site.'=>'Ìtòlẹ́sẹẹsẹ abẹ́lé kò sí lórí ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí.','A translation job runs as the person who starts it, so a user must be signed in.'=>'Iṣẹ́ ìyédèpadà kan ń ṣiṣẹ́ gẹ́gẹ́ bí ẹni tó bẹ̀rẹ̀ rẹ̀, nítorí náà olùlò gbọ́dọ̀ wọlé.','There is nothing you are allowed to translate in that selection.'=>'Kò sí ohun kankan tí a fàyègbà yín láti túmọ̀ nínú àṣàyàn yẹn.','That item is not part of a translation job.'=>'Nkan yẹn kii ṣe apakan iṣẹ itumọ.','That item is already translated, so there is nothing to retry. To retry every failed item of a job, run wp tranzly jobs retry-failed with the job ID, or retry each one from the job\'s list of what failed.'=>'A ti ṣe ìtumọ̀ ohun yẹn tẹ́lẹ̀, nítorí náà kò sí ohun tí a lè tún gbìyànjú. Láti tún gbogbo ohun tí ó kùnà nínú iṣẹ́ kan gbìyànjú, lo wp tranzly jobs retry-failed pẹ̀lú ID iṣẹ́ náà, tàbí kí o tún ọ̀kọ̀ọ̀kan gbìyànjú láti inú àtòjọ àwọn ohun tí ó kùnà nínú iṣẹ́ náà.','That item is already waiting to be translated.'=>'Nkan yẹn ti wa ni idaduro tẹlẹ lati ṣe itumọ rẹ.','There is no translation job with that ID.'=>'Kò sí iṣẹ́ ìtúmọ̀ pẹ̀lú ID yẹn.','You are not allowed to change that translation.'=>'A ko fun ọ ni aṣẹ lati yi itumọ yẹn pada.','Translating this item stopped with an error in WordPress or another plugin. The details are below; retry it once the cause is fixed.'=>'Titumọ ohun yii duro pẹlu aṣiṣe kan ninu WordPress tabi ohun-elo afikun miiran. Awọn alaye wa ni isalẹ; gbiyanju rẹ lẹẹkansi ni kete ti a ba ti ṣatunṣe idi rẹ.','Tranzly is not set up on this site.'=>'A kò tíì ṣètò Tranzly lórí ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí.','This item\'s group already has a %1$s version (#%2$d).'=>'Ẹgbẹ́ nǹkan yìí ti ní ẹ̀dà %1$s tẹ́lẹ̀ (#%2$d).','An item cannot be its own translation.'=>'Nkan kan ko le jẹ itumọ ti ara rẹ.','That item is already a translation of something else. Unlink it first.'=>'Nkan yẹn ti jẹ itumọ nkan miiran tẹlẹ. Yọ ọna asopọ rẹ kuro lakọkọ.','The translation link could not be saved.'=>'A kò le fi àjápọ̀ ìyípadà èdè pamọ́.','That text cannot be translated here.'=>'A ko le tumọ ọrọ yẹn nibi.','That media text cannot be translated here.'=>'A ko le ṣe itumọ ọrọ iroyin yẹn nibi.','A translation can be published or kept as a draft.'=>'A le tẹ itumọ kan jade tabi ki a fi pamọ gẹgẹbi awoṣe.','You are not allowed to publish this kind of content.'=>'A kò gba ọ láàyè láti tẹ irú àkóónú yìí jáde.','This item is already written in that language.'=>'A ti kọ nkan yii tẹlẹ ni ede yẹn.','This translation was edited by a person (or imported), so it is protected. Unlock it to translate it again.'=>'A ṣe àtúnṣe ìtumọ̀ yìí láti ọwọ́ ẹnìkan (tàbí a kójọ wọle), nítorí náà a dáàbò bò ó. Ṣí i láti tún un túmọ̀ sí i.','That item does not exist.'=>'Nkan yẹn kò sí.','No translation engine is set up yet. Add a key for one in Tranzly → Engines.'=>'A kò tíì ṣètò ẹ̀rọ ìyédèpadà kankan. Ṣe àfikún kókórọ́ fún ọ̀kan ní Tranzly → Engines.','That translation engine is not set up yet: add its key first.'=>'Ẹ̀rọ ìtumọ̀ yẹn kò tíì di títò: kọ́kọ́ fi kọ́kọ́rọ́ rẹ̀ kún un.','The same text is being translated by another job right now; this item will use that answer.'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ kan náà ni iṣẹ́ mìíràn ń ṣe ìyípadà rẹ̀ lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́ báyìí; nǹkan yìí yóò lo èsì yẹn.','No translation engine could take this item.'=>'Kò sí ẹ̀rọ ìyédèpadà tó lè gba nǹkan yìí.','The engine did not return a translation for every part of this item. Nothing was changed.'=>'Ẹńjìnnì náà kò dá ìyípadà èdè padà fún apá kọ̀ọ̀kan ti nǹkan yìí. Kò sí ohun tí a yí padà.','Each language must be one of the site\'s languages, with an available engine.'=>'Èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan gbọ́dọ̀ jẹ́ ọ̀kan lára ​​àwọn èdè ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù náà, pẹ̀lú ẹ̀rọ tó wà lárọ̀ọ́wọ́tó.','Each language\'s AI model must name one of the site\'s languages (or all other languages), an AI provider and one of its models.'=>'Àwòṣe AI ti èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan gbọ́dọ̀ dárúkọ ọ̀kan lára àwọn èdè ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù náà (tàbí gbogbo àwọn èdè yòókù), olùpèsè AI kan àti ọ̀kan lára àwọn àwòṣe rẹ̀.','%1$s is not one of the models of %2$s. Pick one from the list, or add it in the AI settings first.'=>'%1$s kì í ṣe ọ̀kan nínú àwọn àwòṣe ti %2$s. Yan ọ̀kan látinú àtòjọ náà, tàbí kọ́kọ́ fi kún un nínú àwọn ètò AI.','The fallback list may only name available engines.'=>'Àtòjọ ààbò lè dárúkọ àwọn ẹ̀rọ tó wà nìkan.','A monthly cap is an amount in US dollars, zero or more, for an available engine.'=>'Òpin oṣooṣù jẹ́ iye kan ní dọ́là US, oókan tàbí jù bẹ́ẹ̀ lọ, fún ẹ̀rọ tó wà lárọ̀ọ́wọ́tó.','Glossary entries must be grouped by one of the site\'s languages.'=>'A gbọ́dọ̀ kó àwọn ìwọlé atúmọ̀-èdè jọ nípa ọ̀kan nínú àwọn èdè ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù náà.','Tone is set per site language: formality default,