pata ninu akọọlẹ Dasibodu Olumulo rẹ.','For automatic delivery of security & feature updates, and license management & protection, %s needs to:'=>'Fún ìfúni láifọwọ́yí ti àwọn àmúgbégà àbò àti àwọn àbùdá, àti ìṣàkóso àti ààbò ìwé-àṣẹ, %s nílò láti:','For delivery of security & feature updates, and license management, %s needs to'=>'Fún ìfiranṣẹ́ àwọn ìfidàkọṣe ààbò & àwọn àbùdá, àti ìṣàkóso ìwé-àṣẹ, %s nílò láti','Freemius is our licensing and software updates engine'=>'Freemius jẹ́ ẹ̀rọ ìwé-àṣẹ àti àwọn ìmúdàgbàsókè sọfitiwia wa','If this is a long term duplicate, to keep automatic updates and paid functionality after %1$s, please %2$s.'=>'Ti eyi ba jẹ ẹda ti a ṣe fun igba pipẹ, lati tẹsiwaju gbigba awọn imudojuiwọn aladaaṣe ati awọn iṣẹ sisanwo lẹhin %1$s, jọwọ %2$s.','Is %2$s a duplicate of %4$s?'=>'Ṣe %2$s jẹ ẹda ti %4$s?','Join the Beta Program'=>'Darapọ mọ Eto Beta','Join the Beta program'=>'Darapọ mọ eto Beta','License'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ','License Key'=>'Kókó Àṣẹ','License key'=>'Kókó àṣẹ','Monthly'=>'Oṣooṣù','Names, slugs, versions, and if active or not'=>'Àwọn orúkọ, slugs, àwọn àtúnṣe, àti bóyá wọ́n ń ṣiṣẹ́ tàbí bẹ́ẹ̀ kọ́','New Version Available'=>'Ẹ̀yà Tuntun Wà','Optional'=>'Aṣayan','Plan'=>'Ètò','Products'=>'Àwọn Ọjà','Sharing diagnostic data helps to provide additional functionality that\'s relevant to your website, avoid WordPress or PHP version incompatibilities that can break the website, and recognize which languages & regions the %s should be translated and tailored to.'=>'Pipin data iwadii aisan n ṣe iranlọwọ lati pese iṣẹ afikun ti o baamu si oju opo wẹẹbu rẹ, yago fun aisi ibaramu ẹya WordPress tabi PHP ti o le ba oju opo wẹẹbu jẹ, ati lati mọ iru awọn ede & agbegbe ti o yẹ ki a tumọ %s si ati ṣe deede fun.','So you can reuse the license when the %s is no longer active.'=>'Kí ẹ lè tún ìwé-àṣẹ náà lò nígbà tí %s kò bá ṣiṣẹ́ mọ́.','Subscription'=>'Ìforúkọsílẹ̀','The %1$s will be periodically sending essential license data to %2$s to check for security and feature updates, and verify the validity of your license.'=>'%1$s yóò máa fi àwọn dátà pàtàkì nípa ìwé-àṣẹ ránṣẹ́ sí %2$s lẹ́ẹ̀kọ̀ọ̀kan láti yẹ àwọn àmúgbéga ààbò àti ti àwọn àbùdá wò, àti láti fìdí bí ìwé-àṣẹ yín ṣe wúlò múlẹ̀.','There is a %1$s of %2$s available.'=>'%1$s ti %2$s wa larọwọto.','To ensure compatibility and avoid conflicts with your installed plugins and themes.'=>'Lati rii daju ibamu ati yago fun awọn ija pẹlu awọn afikun ati awọn akori ti o fi sori ẹrọ rẹ.','Trial'=>'Idanwo','View %s State'=>'Wo Ipò %s','View Basic %s Info'=>'Wo Àwọn Ìsọfúnni %s Ìpìlẹ̀','Yes, %2$s is a duplicate of %4$s for the purpose of testing, staging, or development.'=>'Bẹ́ẹ̀ni, %2$s jẹ́ àdàkọ ti %4$s fún ète ìdánwò, ìpele ìpalẹ̀mọ́, tàbí ìdàgbàsókè.','You have a %s license.'=>'O ni iwe-aṣẹ %s kan.','You have purchased a %s license.'=>'O ti ra iwe-aṣẹ %s kan.','You should receive a confirmation email for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s. Please make sure you click the button in that email to %3$s.'=>'O yẹ ki o gba imeeli ìmúdájú fun %1$s sinu àpótí ìfiranṣẹ rẹ ni %2$s. Jọwọ rii daju pe o tẹ bọtini ti o wa ninu imeeli yẹn lati %3$s.','days'=>'àwọn ọjọ́','deactivating'=>'Ń sọ di alaiṣiṣẹ','hour'=>'wákàtí','hours'=>'awọn wakati','license'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ','optional'=>'aṣayan','products'=>'Àwọn ọjà','skip'=>'Fò','subscription'=>'Ìforúkọsílẹ̀','trial'=>'Idanwo','Clone resolution admin notice products list labelProducts'=>'Àwọn Ọjà','as activating pluginActivating'=>'Ó ń mú ṣiṣẹ́','as software licenseLicense'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ','close a windowDismiss'=>'Fojufo','close windowDismiss'=>'Fojufo','like websitesSites'=>'Àwọn ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù','nounPricing'=>'Iye owó','trial periodTrial'=>'Àdánwò','verbOpt In'=>'Kópa','verbOpt Out'=>'Yọwọ́ kúrò','verbSkip'=>'Fò','verbUpgrade'=>'Ṣe àgbéga','x-ago%s ago'=>'%s sẹ́yìn','Blocks with repeated items, and synced patterns'=>'Àwọn bulọ́ọ̀kì pẹ̀lú àwọn nǹkan tí a tún sọ, àti àwọn àpẹẹrẹ tí a fipamọ́ papọ̀','WooCommerce products'=>'Àwọn ọjà WooCommerce','Comments and reviews'=>'Àwọn àròjinlẹ̀ àti àwọn àtúnyẹ̀wò','Translated automatically from %s.'=>'A túmọ̀ rẹ̀ láti %s nípa lílo ẹ̀rọ aládàáṣiṣẹ́.','WooCommerce currencies'=>'Àwọn owó WooCommerce','Currency'=>'Owó','The rate source does not quote %s, the shop\'s currency.'=>'Orísun ìwọ̀n kò sọ iye %s, owó ilé-ìtajà náà.','"%s" is not a currency WooCommerce knows, or it is the shop\'s own currency.'=>'"%s" kii ṣe owó tí WooCommerce mọ̀, tàbí ó jẹ́ owó ti ilé-ìtajà náà fúnra rẹ̀.','Enter a rate above zero for %s, like 0.92.'=>'Tẹ oṣuwọn kan ti o ga ju odo lọ fun %s, bii 0.92.','Rounding steps and price endings are amounts, like 0.05 or 0.99.'=>'Awọn igbesẹ yiyipo ati awọn opin idiyele jẹ awọn iye, bii 0.05 tabi 0.99.','Custom fields (ACF, Meta Box, Pods)'=>'Àwọn pápá àṣà (ACF, Meta Box, Pods)','Choose translate, copy or leave empty for each field.'=>'Yan túmọ̀, da kọ tàbí fi sílẹ̀ ní òfo fún pápá kọ̀ọ̀kan.','Forms (Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms, Fluent Forms)'=>'Àwọn fọ́ọ̀mù (Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms, Fluent Forms)','I enter the rates myself'=>'Èmi fúnra mi ni mo ń tẹ àwọn oye náà wọlé','European Central Bank, updated daily (free, no account needed)'=>'Banki Àgbáyé ti Yuroopu, a máa ń sọ dọ̀tun lójoojúmọ́ (ọ̀fẹ́, kò nílò àkántì)','The European Central Bank answered %d. The last rates are kept.'=>'Bankigbẹhin Central ti Yuroopu dahun %d. Awọn oṣuwọn to kẹhin ni a tọju.','The European Central Bank\'s feed held no rates. The last rates are kept.'=>'Fifi-ranṣẹ ti Banki Central ti Yuroopu ko ni awọn oṣuwọn kankan ninu. Awọn oṣuwọn to kẹhin ni a tọju.','That exchange-rate source is not available.'=>'Orísun oṣùwọ̀n pàṣípààrọ̀ owó yẹn kò sí.','SEO plugins (Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress, All in One SEO)'=>'Àwọn ohun àfikún SEO (Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress, All in One SEO)','Theme and plugin text'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ àkòrí àti àfikún','That theme or plugin is not active on this site.'=>'Koko-ọ̀rọ̀ tabi àfikún yẹn kò ṣiṣẹ́ lórí ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí.','The action could not be completed. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact the site administrator.'=>'A ko le pari igbese naa. Gbiyanju lẹẹkansi, ti o ba si tesiwaju lati kuna, kan si alabojuto aaye ayelujara naa.','Connect an AI app'=>'So ohun èlò AI pọ̀','This connection request has expired. Go back to the app and start connecting again.'=>'Ìbéèrè ìsopọ̀ yìí ti parí. Padà sí inú àpù náà kí o sì bẹ̀rẹ̀ sí ní sopọ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.','%1$s is asking to use %2$s on this site as %3$s. It can do only what your WordPress account is allowed to do, and you can disconnect it at any time from the AI agents (MCP) settings.'=>'%1$s n tọrọ lati lo %2$s lori aaye yii gẹgẹbi %3$s. O le ṣe ohun ti a gba akọọlẹ WordPress rẹ laaye lati ṣe nikan, ati pe o le ge asopọ rẹ nigbakugba lati awọn eto awọn aṣoju AI (MCP).','%1$s identified itself from %2$s.'=>'%1$s dá ara rẹ̀ mọ̀ láti %2$s.','%1$s registered itself automatically. Only continue if you started this from %2$s.'=>'%1$s forúkọsílẹ̀ fúnra rẹ̀ láìfọwọ́ṣe. Tẹ̀síwájú kìkì bí o bá bẹ̀rẹ̀ èyí láti %2$s.','Your account cannot use these tools on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Àkọọ́lẹ̀ rẹ kò lè lo àwọn irinṣẹ́ wọ̀nyí lórí ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí. Béèrè lọ́wọ́ alábòójútó.','After you answer you will go back to %s.'=>'Lẹ́yìn tí ẹ bá dáhùn, ẹ ó padà sí %s.','Allow %s'=>'Gba %s láàyè','Do not allow'=>'Maa ṣe gba laaye','A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability\'s input schema.'=>'Iye ti a beere fun sonu tabi o ni fọọmu ti ko tọ. Ṣayẹwo ilana titẹwọle ti agbara naa.','The site refused the request.'=>'Ojú-òpó náà kọ ìbéèrè náà.','Unknown tool.'=>'Irinṣẹ́ àìmọ̀.','AI agents (MCP)'=>'Àwọn aṣojú AI (MCP)','Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user (Claude and ChatGPT by approving them here, others with an application password) and can do only what that user is allowed to do.'=>'Gba awọn oluranlọwọ AI laaye bii Claude, Cursor tabi VS Code lati ṣiṣẹ lori aaye yii fun ọ nipasẹ MCP (Model Context Protocol). Wọn wọle bi olumulo WordPress (Claude ati ChatGPT nipa fọwọsi wọn nibi, awọn miiran pẹlu ọrọ igbaniwọle ohun elo) ati pe wọn le ṣe ohun ti olumulo yẹn nikan ni a gba laaye lati ṣe.','AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.'=>'Àwọn aṣojú AI nílò WordPress 6.9 tàbí tuntun sí i. Ṣe àfikún sí WordPress láti lò wọ́n.','Allow AI agents (MCP)'=>'Gba awọn aṣoju AI (MCP) laaye','Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all.'=>'Paa: awọn irinṣẹ ti o wa ni isalẹ ati awọn ipa ọna REST wọn ko forukọsilẹ rara.','Connection address (MCP endpoint)'=>'Àdírẹ́ẹ̀sì ìsopọ̀ (ibùdó-opin MCP)','Claude and ChatGPT: sign in instead'=>'Claude àti ChatGPT: wọlé dípò','Add the connection address as a custom connector in Claude, or as an app in ChatGPT developer mode. They open this site so you can approve them; no password to copy.'=>'Ṣafikun adirẹsi asopọ naa gẹgẹbi asopọ aṣa ninu Claude, tabi gẹgẹbi ohun elo ninu ipo olupilẹṣẹ ChatGPT. Wọn ṣii aaye yii ki ẹ le fọwọsi wọn; ko si ọrọ igbaniwọle lati daakọ.','AI apps connected to your account:'=>'Awọn ohun elo AI ti a so pọ mọ akọọlẹ rẹ:','Other AI apps: an application password'=>'Awọn ohun elo AI miiran: ọrọ igbaniwọle ohun elo kan','Create an application password for your user'=>'Ṣẹda ọ̀rọ̀ìpamọ́ ohun-èlò fún olùlò rẹ','Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:'=>'Ṣafikun eyi si awọn eto MCP ti app AI rẹ, pẹlu orukọ olumulo rẹ ati ọrọ igbaniwọle yẹn:','VS Code: put the same entry under "servers" in .vscode/mcp.json, not under "mcpServers".'=>'VS Code: fi àkọsílẹ̀ kan náà sábẹ́ "servers" nínú .vscode/mcp.json, kì í ṣe sábẹ́ "mcpServers".','Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):'=>'Awọn irinṣẹ ti aṣoju AI le lo nihin (%d):','User guide: AI agents and MCP'=>'Itọsọna olumulo: Awọn aṣoju AI ati MCP','Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP'=>'Àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ olùgbédàgbà: àwọn agbára, REST àti MCP','Translate this site\'s content and check its translations with Tranzly.'=>'Ṣe itumọ akoonu aaye yii ki o ṣayẹwo awọn itumọ rẹ pẹlu Tranzly.','Languages, translation and translation status.'=>'Àwọn èdè, ìtumọ̀ àti ipò ìtumọ̀.','List languages'=>'Ṣe àkójọ àwọn èdè','Lists the site\'s languages. The first one is the language the original content is written in.'=>'Ṣe àkójọ àwọn èdè ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù náà. Èkíní ni èdè tí a kọ àkóónú àtìbẹ̀rẹ̀ náà sí.','List translation engines'=>'Ṣe àkójọ àwọn ẹ̀rọ ìtúmọ̀-èdè','Lists the translation engines, whether each is set up, and which one is used when none is named.'=>'Ó ń ṣe àkójọ àwọn ẹ̀rọ ìtumọ̀, bóyá wọ́n ti ṣe ètò kọ̀ọ̀kan wọn, àti èyí tí a ń lò nígbà tí a kò bá dárúkọ èyíkéyìí.','Translate a post or page'=>'Ṣe afitẹle tabi oju-iwe kan ni itumọ','Translates one post or page into one or more of the site\'s languages with a translation engine, creating each translation or updating it. New translations are drafts unless publish is true. A translation a person edited is skipped unless force is true.'=>'Ó ń ṣe ìyípadà èdè fún àtẹ̀jáde tàbí ojú-ewé kan sí ọ̀kan tàbí púpọ̀ nínú àwọn èdè ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù náà pẹ̀lú ẹ̀rọ ìyípadà èdè, ní ṣíṣẹ̀dá ìyípadà èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan tàbí sísọ ọ́ di ọ̀tun. Àwọn ìyípadà èdè tuntun jẹ́ àkọ́kọṣe àyàfi bí publish bá jẹ́ tòótọ́ (true). A máa fò ìyípadà èdè tí ẹnì kan ti ṣe àtúnṣe sí dáfà àyàfi bí force bá jẹ́ tòótọ́ (true).','Codes of languages set up on this site, e.g. de_DE, or just de when only one German is listed.'=>'Àwọn kóòdù àwọn èdè tí a gbé kalẹ̀ lórí ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí, fún àpẹẹrẹ de_DE, tàbí de lásán nígbà tí èdè Jámánì kan péré bá wà nínú àtòjọ.','The id of a translation engine set up on this site; the default engine when omitted.'=>'ID ti ẹrọ ìtumọ̀ tí a ṣètò lórí ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí; ẹrọ aiyipada nígbà tí a bá fi sílẹ̀.','Translation status'=>'Ipò ìyípadà èdè','With a post ID: each language\'s translation of that post, whether it is out of date, and who wrote it. Without one: how much of the site is translated, per language.'=>'Pẹlu ID ifiweranṣẹ kan: itumọ ifiweranṣẹ yẹn fun ede kọọkan, boya o ti di igba atijọ, ati ẹni ti o kọ ọ. Laisi rẹ: iye ti aaye naa ti a tumọ, fun ede kọọkan.','Translate my site'=>'Ṣe afitẹkọ ojula mi','A guided workflow: the agent checks the languages and engine, estimates the cost, and translates what is missing, asking before it spends or publishes.'=>'Ìlànà iṣẹ́ amọ̀nà: aṣojú náà yóò yẹ àwọn èdè àti ẹ̀rọ wò, ṣe ìṣirò owó rẹ̀, yóò sì ṣe ìtumọ̀ ohun tí ó kù, pẹ̀lú bíbérè kí ó tó náwó tàbí tẹ̀ ẹ́ jáde.','The languages to translate into, e.g. German and French.'=>'Awọn ede lati tumọ si, fun apẹẹrẹ Jaman ati Faranse.','Translate this WordPress site into: %s. Steps: 1) call tranzly-list-languages; if a language is missing, ask me before adding it with tranzly-update-settings; 2) call tranzly-list-engines and make sure one is set up (otherwise tell me which key to add); 3) call tranzly-translation-status for the whole site and tranzly-estimate for what is missing, and tell me the cost before spending anything; 4) after I agree, translate with tranzly-bulk-translate if it is available (Pro), otherwise post by post with tranzly-translate-post; 5) new translations stay drafts unless I say to publish; 6) finish with tranzly-translation-status and list what is still missing.'=>'Ṣe itumọ aaye ayelujara WordPress yii si: %s. Awọn igbesẹ: 1) pe tranzly-list-languages; ti ede kan ba sonu, beere lọwọ mi ki o to fi kun un pẹlu tranzly-update-settings; 2) pe tranzly-list-engines ki o si rii daju pe a ti ṣeto ọkan (bibẹẹkọ sọ kọkọrọ ti mo gbọdọ fi kun fun mi); 3) pe tranzly-translation-status fun gbogbo aaye ayelujara naa ati tranzly-estimate fun ohun ti o sonu, ki o si sọ iye owo rẹ fun mi ki o to na ohunkohun; 4) lẹhin ti mo ba gba, ṣe itumọ pẹlu tranzly-bulk-translate ti o ba wa (Pro), bibẹẹkọ ifiweranṣẹ nipasẹ ifiweranṣẹ pẹlu tranzly-translate-post; 5) awọn itumọ titun yoo wa ni akọpamọ ayafi ti mo ba sọ pe ki a tẹ wọn sita; 6) pari pẹlu tranzly-translation-status ki o si ṣe akojọ ohun ti o ṣi sonu.','Name at least one language.'=>'Darukọ o kere ju ede kan.','Read comment handling (Pro)'=>'Ka iṣakoso asọye (Pro)','Returns whether comments are shared across languages or kept per language.'=>'Nígbàtí àwọn àròsọ bá pín kiri àwọn èdè tàbí tí a tọ́jú fún èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan.','Change comment handling (Pro)'=>'Yi ìwọ́wọ́ àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ àsọyé padà (Pro)','Shares comments across a post\'s translations or keeps them per language (mode).'=>'Pín àwọn àròjinlẹ̀ káàkiri àwọn ìtumọ̀ àkòrí tàbí kí o tọ́jú wọn fún èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan (mode).','Read the display options'=>'Ka awọn aṣayan ifihan','Returns the language switcher and credit display options.'=>'Ó ń dá olùyí èdè padà àti àwọn àṣàyàn ìfihàn ìyìn.','Change the display options'=>'Yí àwọn àṣàyàn ìfihàn padà','Changes the switcher (style, flags, names, placement) and the credit line.'=>'Ó yí oluyipada padà (àṣà, àwọn àsíá, àwọn orúkọ, ìfipamọ́) àti ìlà ìyìn.','Read the DeepL usage'=>'Ka lilo DeepL','Returns the characters used and the limit of the saved DeepL key this month.'=>'Ó ń ṣe àfihàn àwọn lẹ́tà tí a lò àti ààlà ti kókó DeepL tí a fi pamọ́ fún oṣù yìí.','Read the engine settings'=>'Ka àwọn ètò ẹ̀rọ náà','Returns the default and fallback engine, per-language engines and AI models, each engine\'s state, the connected AI providers with their models, and this month\'s spend.'=>'Ó ń da ẹ̀rọ àkọ́kọ́ àti ti àfikún, àwọn ẹ̀rọ fún èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan àti àwọn àwòṣe AI, ipò ẹ̀rọ kọ̀ọ̀kan, àwọn olùpèsè AI tí a sopọ̀ pẹ̀lú àwọn àwòṣe wọn, àti ìnáwó oṣù yìí padà.','Change the engine settings'=>'Yi awọn eto ẹnjini pada','Sets the default engine, a fallback engine, per-language engines and per-language AI models (default, fallback, per_lang, models, caps). Everything but the default engine is Pro.'=>'Ó ń ṣètò ẹ̀rọ àkọ́kọ́, ẹ̀rọ àrọ́pò, àwọn ẹ̀rọ fún èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan àti àwọn àwòṣe AI fún èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan (default, fallback, per_lang, models, caps). Ohun gbogbo yàtọ̀ sí ẹ̀rọ àkọ́kọ́ jẹ́ ti Pro.','ID of the default translation engine (deepl, ai, google or microsoft); empty for automatic.'=>'ID ti ẹ̀rọ ìyédèpadà àkọ́kànṣoṣo (deepl, ai, google tàbí microsoft); fi sílẹ̀ ní òfo fún àdáṣe.','Pro: language code => engine ID used for that language.'=>'Pro: koodu ede => ID ẹnjini ti a lo fun ede yẹn.','Pro: engine IDs tried in order when the first one fails.'=>'Pro: a gbiyanju awọn ID ẹrọ lẹsẹsẹ nigbati ekinni ba kuna.','Pro: engine ID => monthly spending cap in US dollars. An AI provider has its own cap, keyed ai: and the provider id, for example ai:anthropic.'=>'Pro: ID ẹ̀rọ => ààlà ìnáwó oṣooṣù ní dọ́là US. Olùpèsè AI kan ní ààlà ti tirẹ̀, pẹ̀lú kọ́kọ́rọ́ ai: àti id olùpèsè náà, fún àpẹẹrẹ ai:anthropic.','Pro: language code => {provider, model} used when the AI engine translates that language; the key * sets the model for every other language. Empty model: the provider\'s recommended one.'=>'Pro: koodu ede => {provider, model} ti a nlo nigbati ẹrọ AI ba n tumọ ede yẹn; kọkọrọ * n ṣeto awoṣe fun gbogbo ede miiran. Awoṣe ti o ṣofo: eyi ti olupese ṣe iṣeduro rẹ.','Save an engine key'=>'Fi kọkọrọ ẹnjini pamọ́','Saves the API key (and region for Microsoft) of DeepL, Google or Microsoft; empty removes it. Keys are stored encrypted and never returned.'=>'Ó ń fi kọ́kọ́rọ́ API (àti agbègbè fún Microsoft) pamọ́ ti DeepL, Google tàbí Microsoft; fífi sílẹ̀ ní òfo yóò yọ ọ́ kúrò. A fi àwọn kọ́kọ́rọ́ pamọ́ pẹ̀lú ààbò ìyédà kọ̀ọ̀kan, a kì í sì padà fi wọ́n hàn láé.','Estimate a translation'=>'Ṣe iṣiro itumọ','Estimates characters and cost to translate posts (posts or post_type) into languages (langs) with an engine, before spending anything.'=>'Ṣe iṣiro awọn lẹta ati iye owo lati tumọ awọn ifiweranṣẹ (posts tabi post_type) si awọn ede (langs) pẹlu ẹrọ kan, ṣaaju lilo ohunkohun.','Import a translated file (Pro)'=>'Gbe faili ti a tumọ wọle (Pro)','Uploads a Tranzly XLIFF or CSV file (content, filename) translated elsewhere; answers a token that identifies the upload for the import.'=>'Ó ń gbé fáìlì Tranzly XLIFF tàbí CSV (àkóónú, orúkọ fáìlì) tí a túmọ̀ níbòmíràn sí orí ayélujára; ó ń dá àmì ìdámọ̀ padà tí ó ń ṣe ìdámọ̀ ìgbésórí-ayélujára náà fún ìgbéwọlé.','The XLIFF or CSV file\'s text.'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ inú fáìlì XLIFF tàbí CSV náà.','The file name, e.g. site-de.xlf.'=>'Orukọ faili naa, f.k. site-de.xlf.','List plugins to migrate from (Pro)'=>'Ṣe akojọ awọn afikun lati gbe lati (Pro)','Lists WPML, Polylang and TranslatePress data found on this site that can be imported.'=>'Ṣe akojọ data WPML, Polylang ati TranslatePress ti a rii lori aaye yii ti o le ṣe agbewọle.','Migrate from WPML, Polylang or TranslatePress (Pro)'=>'Kírákò láti WPML, Polylang tàbí TranslatePress (Pro)','Imports the next page of translations from another multilingual plugin (mode: dry-run or run; cursor).'=>'N gbe oju-iwe ti o tẹle ti awọn itumọ wọle lati inu ohun-itanna ọpọlọpọ ede miiran (ipo: dry-run tabi run; kọsọ).','Write an imported file (Pro)'=>'Kọ faili ti a wọle (Pro)','Writes the next page of posts from an uploaded translation file (repeat with after until done).'=>'Kọ oju-iwe ti o tẹle ti awọn ifiweranṣẹ lati faili itumọ ti a gbe sori ayelujara (tun ṣe pẹlu after titi ti o fi pari).','Read the integrations'=>'Ka àwọn àsopọ̀','Lists the SEO, WooCommerce, page-builder and form plugins Tranzly supports and which are active here.'=>'Ṣe àkójọ àwọn àfikún SEO, WooCommerce, aṣẹ̀dá ojú-ewé àti fọ́ọ̀mù tí Tranzly ń tìlẹ́yìn tí wọ́n sì ń ṣiṣẹ́ níhìn-ín.','List translation jobs'=>'Ṣàkọsílẹ̀ àwọn iṣẹ́ ìyédèpadà','Lists background translation jobs, newest first, with progress.'=>'Ṣe akojọ awọn iṣẹ iyipada ede lẹhin, tuntun julọ ni akọkọ, pẹlu ilọsiwaju.','Start a translation job'=>'Bẹ̀rẹ̀ iṣẹ́ ìyédèpadà','Starts a background job translating listed posts (posts) or a whole post type into languages (langs).'=>'Bẹrẹ iṣẹ abẹlẹ ti n ṣe itumọ awọn ifiweranṣẹ ti a ṣe akojọ (posts) tabi gbogbo iru ifiweranṣẹ sinu awọn ede (langs).','Retry or hand off a failed item'=>'Gbiyanju lẹẹkansi tabi fi nkan ti o kuna le ẹlomiran lọwọ','Retries a failed item (action: retry, optionally with another engine) or marks it for translating by hand (action: by-hand).'=>'Tun nkan ti o kuna gbiyanju (igbese: retry, pẹlu aṣayan lilo ẹrọ miiran) tabi samisi rẹ fun titumọ pẹlu ọwọ (igbese: by-hand).','Read a job\'s progress'=>'Ka ilọsiwaju iṣẹ kan','Returns one job\'s progress and counts.'=>'Ó ń dá ìtẹ̀síwájú àti àwọn iye ti iṣẹ́ kan padà.','Cancel a job'=>'Fagilee iṣẹ́ kan','Stops a job; translations already made are kept.'=>'Ó dá iṣẹ́ kan dúró; àwọn ìyédèpadà tí a ti ṣe tẹ́lẹ̀ ni a ó pa mọ́.','Read a job\'s failures'=>'Ka àwọn ìkùnà iṣẹ́ kan','Lists a job\'s failed items with the reason for each.'=>'Ṣe àkójọ àwọn ohun iṣẹ́ tí kò yọrí sí rere pẹ̀lú ìdí fún ọ̀kọ̀ọ̀kan.','Read the licence'=>'Ka àdéhùn àṣẹ','Returns this site\'s Tranzly plan, licence state, renewal date and what the plan includes.'=>'Ó ń da ètò Tranzly ti ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí, ipò ìwé-àṣẹ, ọjọ́ ìsọdọ̀tun, àti ohun tí ètò náà ní nínú padà.','Disconnect from support'=>'Ge asopọ kuro lara iranlọwọ','Disconnects this site from support.'=>'Ó ge ààyè yìí kúrò lára àtìlẹ́yìn.','Read the support connection'=>'Ka asopọ atilẹyin','Says whether this site is connected to Zinn Digital® support, and as whom.'=>'Ó ń sọ bóyá ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí ní ìsopọ̀ pẹ̀lú àtìlẹ́yìn Zinn Digital®, àti bí ta.','Connect to support'=>'Sopọ mọ atilẹyin','Connects this site to Zinn Digital® support (name, email, consent).'=>'Ó so ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí pọ̀ mọ́ àtìlẹ́yìn Zinn Digital® (orúkọ, imeeli, ìfọwọ́sí).','Consent to support diagnostics'=>'Gba sí iṣayẹwo atilẹyin','Records the administrator\'s consent to send diagnostics with support tickets.'=>'Ó ń ṣe àkọsílẹ̀ ìfọwọ́sí olùmójútó láti fi àwọn àyẹ̀wò ránṣẹ́ pẹ̀lú àwọn tíkẹ́ẹ̀tì ìtìlẹ́yìn.','True records the administrator\'s consent to send diagnostics with support tickets.'=>'True n ṣe akọsilẹ ifohunsi oludari lati fi awọn iwadii aisan ranṣẹ pẹlu awọn tiketi atilẹyin.','Read the site diagnostics'=>'Ka àyẹ̀wò ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù','Returns the diagnostics a support ticket would carry: versions, active plugins, limits and recent errors.'=>'Ń dá àwọn àyẹ̀wò tí tíkẹ́ètì ìrànwọ́ yóò ní padà: àwọn àgbéjáde, àwọn àlopò tí ń ṣiṣẹ́, àwọn ààlà àti àwọn àṣìṣe àìpẹ́.','Open a support ticket'=>'Ṣí tikẹ́ẹ̀tì àtìlẹ́yìn kan','Files a support ticket (subject, message, kind, email), with this site\'s diagnostics when the administrator agreed. It never creates a login or sends one.'=>'Fáìlì tikẹ́ẹ̀tì àtìlẹ́yìn kan (orí-ọ̀rọ̀, ìránṣẹ́, irúfẹ́, ímeèlì), pẹ̀lú àwọn àyẹ̀wò ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí nígbà tí alámòójútó bá gbà. Kò ní dásílẹ̀ ìwọlé tàbí fi ọ̀kan ránṣẹ́ láéláé.','The ticket subject (up to 200 characters).'=>'Kókó-ọ̀rọ̀ àtìkẹ́ẹ̀tì náà (tó tó lẹ́tà 200).','What happened, or the question.'=>'Kí ló ṣẹlẹ̀, tàbí ìbéèrè náà.','The kind of request; help when omitted.'=>'Irú ìbéèrè náà; ìrànwọ́ nígbà tí a bá fi sílẹ̀.','Reply address; the connected support email when omitted.'=>'Àdírẹ́sì ìdáhùn; imeeli àtìlẹ́yìn tí a sopọ̀ nígbà tí a bá foju fò ó.','Name to reply to.'=>'Orukọ lati fesi si.','True attaches this site\'s diagnostics (needs the administrator\'s consent).'=>'True so àwọn àyẹ̀wò ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí pọ̀ (ó nílò àṣẹ olùṣàkóso).','Start the free Pro trial'=>'Bẹrẹ idanwo ọfẹ Pro','Starts the 14-day Tranzly Pro trial for this site (no payment needed).'=>'Bẹrẹ idanwo ọjọ 14 Tranzly Pro fun aaye yii (ko nilo sisanwo).','Read the Tranzly 2.x import'=>'Ka agbewọle Tranzly 2.x','Returns the state and report of importing translations from Tranzly 2.x.'=>'Ó ń da ipò àti ìròyìn kíkó àwọn ìyédèpadà wọlé láti Tranzly 2.x padà.','Import Tranzly 2.x translations'=>'Kó àwọn ìyédèpadà Tranzly 2.x wọlé','Runs the 2.x import: dry-run (report only), run, or undo.'=>'Nṣe àmúpé wọle 2.x: ìdánwò (ìròyìn nikan), ṣiṣẹ, tabi dá pada.','Translate an image\'s text'=>'Ṣe itumọ ọ̀rọ̀ inú àwòrán','Saves an image\'s alt text, title or caption (field) in a language (lang).'=>'Fi ọ̀rọ̀ àlàyé àwòrán (alt text), àkọlé tàbí àkọsílẹ̀ rẹ̀ (pápá) pamọ́ ní èdè kan (lang).','Read the menus per language'=>'Ka àwọn akojọ aṣayan fun èdè kọọkan','Returns which menu each language shows in each menu location.'=>'Ó ń da ètò àkójọ tí èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan ń fi hàn ní ibi àkójọ kọ̀ọ̀kan padà.','Set the menus per language'=>'Ṣeto awọn akojọ aṣayan fun ede kọọkan','Assigns a menu per language per location (map).'=>'Ó ń yan akojọ aṣayan kan fun èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan fun ibi kọ̀ọ̀kan (àwòrán ilẹ̀).','Protect or unlock a translation'=>'Dabobo tabi ṣi itumọ kan silẹ','Protects a translation from being overwritten by the engine (protected: true), or unlocks it.'=>'Ó ń dáàbò bo ìtúmọ̀ kí ẹ̀rọ má baà kọ sori rẹ̀ (protected: true), tàbí kí ó ṣí i silẹ̀.','Read a quality report (Pro)'=>'Ka iroyin didara (Pro)','Returns a translation\'s AI quality report: score and the segments it flagged.'=>'Nfi iroyin didara AI ti itumọ kan pada: Dimegilio ati awọn apakan ti a samisi.','Approve or reject a translation (Pro)'=>'Fọwọ́sí tàbí kọ ìtúmọ̀ kan (Pro)','Approves a translation (and publishes it when the original is published) or sends it back (decision, note).'=>'Fọwọsi itumọ kan (ati titẹjade nigbati a ba tẹ atilẹba jade) tabi da a pada (ipinnu, akọsilẹ).','Read a translation side by side'=>'Ka ìtumọ̀ lẹ́gbẹ̀ẹ́kẹ́gbẹ́','Returns a translation\'s segments beside the original\'s, for review and correction.'=>'Ó ń da àwọn apá ìtumọ̀ padà lẹ́gbẹ̀ẹ́ ti àtìbẹ̀rẹ̀, fún àtúnyẹ̀wò àti àtúnṣe.','Correct a translation'=>'Ṣàtúnṣe ìyípadà èdè kan','Saves corrected segments of a translation (segments: key to text); corrected text is protected from re-translation.'=>'Nfi àwọn apá tí a túnṣe nínú ìyípadà èdè pamọ́ (àwọn apá: kókó sí ọ̀rọ̀); a dáàbò bo ọ̀rọ̀ tí a túnṣe kúrò lọ́wọ́ àtún-yípadà.','Unlink a post from its translations'=>'Yọ àsopọ̀ àtẹ̀jáde kan kúrò nínú àwọn ìyédèpadà rẹ̀','Takes a post out of its translation group; it keeps its language.'=>'Ó yọ àtẹ̀jáde kan kúrò nínú àkójọ ìyédèpadà rẹ̀; ó sì ń pa èdè rẹ̀ mọ́.','Read a post\'s translations'=>'Ka àwọn ìtumọ̀ àkọsílẹ̀','Lists a post\'s translation group: every language\'s member with its title, status and edit link.'=>'Ṣe àkójọ ẹgbẹ́ ìtumọ̀ àkọsílẹ̀ kan: ọmọ ẹgbẹ́ èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan pẹ̀lú àkọlé, ipò, àti ìsopọ̀ àtúnṣe rẹ̀.','Create an empty translation'=>'Ṣẹda itumọ ti o ṣofo','Creates a draft translation of a post in a language (lang) to write by hand, without an engine.'=>'Ó ń ṣẹ̀dá àkọsílẹ̀ ìtúmọ̀ àtẹ̀jáde kan ní èdè kan (lang) láti fi ọwọ́ kọ, láìlo ẹ̀rọ.','Link an existing post as a translation'=>'So àtẹ̀jade tó wà tẹ́lẹ̀ mọ́ ọn gẹ́gẹ́ bí ìyédèpadà','Makes an existing post (target) the translation of this post in a language.'=>'Sọ àkọsílẹ̀ tó wà tẹ́lẹ̀ (àfojúsùn) di ìyípadà èdè ti àkọsílẹ̀ yìí ní èdè kan.','Check translations with AI (Pro)'=>'Ṣayẹwo awọn itumọ pẹlu AI (Pro)','Schedules the AI quality check of the next page of a language\'s translations (or the given posts).'=>'Ṣètò àyẹ̀wò dídára AI ti ojú-ìwé tókàn ti àwọn ìyédè ti èdè kan (tàbí àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ tí a pèsè).','Multilingual SEO audit (Pro)'=>'Ayẹwo SEO ọ̀pọ̀ èdè (Pro)','Checks translations for missing SEO titles, descriptions, slugs and hreflang in a language, page by page.'=>'Ó ń yẹ àwọn ìtumọ̀ wò fún àwọn àkọlé SEO, àpèjúwe, slugs àti hreflang tí ó sọnù nínú èdè kan, lójú-ewé dé ojú-ewé.','Change languages and settings'=>'Yi awọn ede ati awọn eto pada','Sets the site\'s languages (languages: list of code and name; the first is the original language), the front-end class prefix, and whether AI agents (MCP) are allowed.'=>'Ṣeto awọn ede aaye naa (awọn ede: akojọ koodu ati orukọ; akọkọ ni ede atilẹba), àsopọ̀wájú kilasi iwaju, ati boya a gba awọn aṣoju AI (MCP) laaye.','Read theme and plugin texts'=>'Ka àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ àkòrí àti àfikún','Returns the theme and plugin texts (scope) in a language with their translations.'=>'Ó ń da àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ àkòrí àti àfikún (ààbò) padà ní èdè kan pẹ̀lú àwọn ìtumọ̀ wọn.','Translate missing theme and plugin texts'=>'Ṣe afikun itumọ awọn ọrọ ti o nsọnu ninu akori ati afikun','Translates the next page of untranslated theme and plugin texts in a language with the default engine (repeat with after until done).'=>'Ó ń ṣe ìyípadà ojú-ewé tí ó kàn nínú àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ àkòrí àti àfikún tí a kò tíì yípadà sí èdè kan pẹ̀lú ẹ̀rọ àtìbẹ̀rẹ̀ (tún un ṣe pẹ̀lú after títí yóò fi parí).','Correct theme and plugin texts'=>'Ṣatunṣe awọn ọrọ akori ati ohun elo afikun','Saves corrected translations of theme and plugin texts (strings); they become protected.'=>'Ó ń fi àwọn ìtumọ̀ tí a ṣàtúnṣe fún àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ (okùn) ti àkòrí àti àfikún pamọ́; wọ́n di èyí tí a dáàbò bò.','Translate what is missing'=>'Ṣe itumọ ohun ti o sonu','Queues translation of every missing (or out-of-date) item in a language and post type.'=>'Fi ìyípadà èdè gbogbo nǹkan tí ó sọ nù (tàbí tí kò bá ìgbà mu) sínú ìtòlẹ́sẹẹsẹ fún èdè àti irú ìfìwéranṣẹ́ kan.','List what is missing or out of date'=>'Ṣe akojọ ohun ti o sonu tabi ti kọja akoko','Lists originals with their translation state in a language (state: missing, stale, current), page by page.'=>'Ṣe àkójọ àwọn àkọ́kọ́ pẹ̀lú ipò ìyédèpadà wọn nínú èdè kan (ipò: kò sí, ti gbó, ti lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́), láti ojú-ìwé dé ojú-ìwé.','Read the site\'s texts in a language'=>'Ka awọn ọrọ aaye ayelujara naa ni ede kan','Returns the site title, tagline and widget texts in a language.'=>'O n da akọle aaye ayelujara, ọrọ-idanimọ ati awọn ọrọ widget pada ni ede kan.','Translate a site text'=>'Ṣe afiwe ọrọ aaye kan','Saves one site text (key) in a language, e.g. the site title or tagline.'=>'Nfi ọ̀rọ̀ ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù kan (kọ́kọ́rọ́) pamọ́ ní èdè kan, fún àpẹẹrẹ àkọlé ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù tàbí gbolohun ọ̀rọ̀.','Translate a category or tag'=>'Ṣe itumọ ẹka tabi aami','Translates one term (category, tag or product attribute) into a language (lang) with an engine, creating or updating its translation.'=>'Ó ń ṣe ògbufọ̀ ọ̀rọ̀ kan (ẹ̀ka, àlẹ̀mọ́ tàbí àbùdá ọjà) sí èdè kan (lang) pẹ̀lú ẹ̀rọ kan, nípa ṣíṣẹ̀dá tàbí ṣíṣe àfikún sí ògbufọ̀ rẹ̀.','Unlink a term from its translations'=>'Yọ àsopọ̀ ọ̀rọ̀ kan kúrò nínú àwọn ìtumọ̀ rẹ̀','Takes a term out of its translation group.'=>'Ó yọ ọ̀rọ̀ kan kúrò nínú ẹgbẹ́ ìtúmọ̀ rẹ̀.','Read a term\'s translations'=>'Ka àwọn ìyípadà èdè ti ọ̀rọ̀ kan','Lists a category\'s or tag\'s translation group.'=>'Ṣe afihan atokọ ẹgbẹ itumọ ti ẹka tabi aami kan.','Create a term translation by hand'=>'Ṣẹda itumọ ọrọ pẹlu ọwọ','Creates a term\'s translation in a language with a name, slug and description you give.'=>'Ṣẹda itumọ ọrọ kan ni ede kan pẹlu orukọ, slug ati apejuwe ti o pese.','Link an existing term as a translation'=>'So ọ̀rọ̀ tó wà tẹ́lẹ̀ mọ́ ọn gẹ́gẹ́ bí ìtumọ̀','Makes an existing term (target) the translation of this term in a language.'=>'Sọ ọ̀rọ̀ tó wà tẹ́lẹ̀ (ibi àfojúsùn) di ìtumọ̀ ọ̀rọ̀ yìí ní èdè kan.','List theme and plugin text sources (Pro)'=>'Ṣe akojọ awọn orisun ọrọ akori ati itanna (Pro)','Lists the themes and plugins whose texts can be scanned for translation, and how many strings each has.'=>'Ṣe àkójọ àwọn àkòrí àti àwọn àfikún tí a lè ṣe àyẹ̀wò àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ wọn fún ìyípadà èdè, àti iye okùn tí ọ̀kọ̀ọ̀kan ní.','Scan a theme or plugin for texts (Pro)'=>'Ṣayẹwo àkòrí tàbí àfikún fún àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ (Pro)','Scans the next page of a component\'s PHP files for translatable texts (repeat with after until done).'=>'Ṣe ayẹwo oju-iwe ti o tẹle ti awọn faili PHP ti paati kan fun awọn ọrọ ti a le tumọ (tun ṣe pẹlu after titi ti yoo fi pari).','Read the address settings'=>'Ka àwọn ètò àdírẹ́sì náà','Returns how languages appear in addresses (folder, subdomain or domain), translated slugs and bases, and noindex for untranslated pages.'=>'N da bi awọn ede ṣe n han ninu awọn adirẹsi pada (folda, subdomain tabi domain), awọn slug ati ipilẹ ti a tumọ, ati noindex fun awọn oju-iwe ti a ko tumọ.','Change the address settings'=>'Yi awọn eto adirẹsi pada','Sets the address mode (mode), per-language domains, translated bases and segments, noindex_untranslated and slug suggestions.'=>'Ṣeto ipo adirẹsi (mode), awọn agbegbe-aṣẹ fun ede kọọkan, awọn ipilẹ ati awọn abala ti a tumọ, noindex_untranslated ati awọn imọran slug.','Estimate translating the site (Pro)'=>'Ṣe iṣiro titumọ aaye ayelujara naa (Pro)','Estimates a whole-site translation in a language (post_types, scope, engine) before starting it.'=>'Ṣe iṣiro itumọ gbogbo-aaye ni ede kan (post_types, scope, engine) ṣaaju ki o to bẹrẹ rẹ.','Read the workflow settings (Pro)'=>'Ka àwọn ètò ìgbésẹ̀-iṣẹ́ (Pro)','Returns auto-translation on publish and on update, review before publish, and the AI quality check\'s threshold, provider and model.'=>'N da itumọ aifọwọyi pada lori titẹjade ati lori imudojuiwọn, atunyẹwo ṣaaju titẹjade, ati ala, olupese ati awoṣe ayẹwo didara AI.','Change the workflow settings (Pro)'=>'Yi awọn eto iṣan-iṣẹ pada (Pro)','Sets on_update (off, stale, translate), on_publish, review, quality_threshold, quality_provider and quality_model.'=>'Ṣeto on_update (off, stale, translate), on_publish, review, quality_threshold, quality_provider ati quality_model.','When an original changes: nothing, mark its translations out of date, or translate them again.'=>'Nígbà tí àkọ́kọ́ bá yípadà: kò sí nǹkan, sàmì sí àwọn ìtumọ̀ rẹ̀ gẹ́gẹ́ bí èyí tí kò bá ìgbà mu mọ́, tàbí tún wọn túmọ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.','Translate a post into every language when it is published.'=>'Ṣe afitúmọ̀ àtẹ̀jáde kan sí gbogbo èdè nígbà tí a bá tẹ̀ ẹ́ jáde.','New translations wait for review instead of being published.'=>'Àwọn ìyédèpadà tuntun ń dúró de àtúnyẹ̀wò dípò kí a tẹ̀ wọ́n jáde.','Quality score below which a translation is flagged.'=>'Maki didara ti o kere si eyiti a o fi se afihan itumọ.','AI provider of the quality check.'=>'Olùpèsè AI fún àyẹ̀wò dídára.','AI model of the quality check.'=>'Àwòṣe AI ti àyẹ̀wò dídára.','Translate the whole site'=>'Ṣe itumọ gbogbo aaye wẹẹbu naa','Starts background translation jobs for every original of the given content types (all translated types when none are given): the missing translations, the out-of-date ones, or all of them. Returns the jobs started, one per language.'=>'Ó ń bẹ̀rẹ̀ àwọn iṣẹ́ ìtumọ̀ lẹ́yìn fún gbogbo àtìbẹ̀rẹ̀ ti àwọn irú àkóónú tí a fúnni (gbogbo àwọn irú tí a túmọ̀ nígbà tí a kò bá fúnni ní kankan): àwọn ìtumọ̀ tí kò sí, àwọn tí kò bá ìgbà mu mọ́, tàbí gbogbo wọn. Ó ń dá àwọn iṣẹ́ tí a bẹ̀rẹ̀ padà, ọ̀kan fún èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan.','Check a translation with AI'=>'Ṣayẹwo ìtumọ̀ pẹ̀lú AI','Has AI compare one translation with its original and score it, and stores the report on the translation. Uses the quality-check AI model set in Tranzly\'s workflow settings.'=>'Ó ń jẹ́ kí AI fi ìtumọ̀ kan wéra pẹ̀lú àtètèkọ́ṣe rẹ̀ kí ó sì fún un ní àmì, ó sì ń tọ́jú ìròyìn náà sára ìtumọ̀ náà. Ó ń lo àwòṣe AI àyẹ̀wò-dídára tí a tò sínú àwọn ètò iṣẹ́-ṣíṣe Tranzly.','The translation\'s post ID.'=>'ID àtẹjade ìtúmọ̀ náà.','Export a file for human translators'=>'Ṣe afiranṣẹ faili kan fun awọn olutumo eniyan','Returns an XLIFF or CSV file (as text) with the originals and their translations in one language, for a translator or a translation agency: the given posts, or a page of up to 100 originals of a content type in a state (missing, stale, translated or all; repeat with after). The same file can be imported back once translated.'=>'Ó ń dá fáìlì XLIFF tàbí CSV padà (gẹ́gẹ́ bí ọ̀rọ̀) pẹ̀lú àwọn àkọ́kọ́ṣe àti àwọn ìtumọ̀ wọn ní èdè kan, fún olùtumọ̀ tàbí ilé-iṣẹ́ ìtumọ̀: àwọn àtẹ̀jade tí a fúnni, tàbí ojú-ewé tí ó tó 100 àkọ́kọ́ṣe ti irú àkóónú kan nínú ipò kan (missing, stale, translated tàbí all; tún ṣe pẹ̀lú after). A lè kó fáìlì kan náà wọlé padà lẹ́yìn tí a bá ti túmọ̀ rẹ̀ tán.','Words never translated (brand and product names).'=>'Àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ tí a kò túmọ̀ rí (orúkọ àmì-ìdánimọ̀ àti ọjà).','Per language code: source term => the translation always used.'=>'Fún kóòdù èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan: ọ̀rọ̀ orísun => ìyípadà èdè tí a máa ń lò nígbà gbogbo.','Per language code: formality (default, more, less) and style instructions.'=>'Fún kóòdù èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan: ìbámu (àtìbẹ̀rẹ̀, púpọ̀ síi, díẹ̀) àti àwọn ìtọ́ni lórí àkàwé.','Read the glossary'=>'Ka àkójọ ọ̀rọ̀','Returns the words never translated, the fixed term translations and the tone per language.'=>'Ó ń da àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ tí a kò túmọ̀ rí, àwọn ìtumọ̀ ọ̀rọ̀ pàtó àti ohùn fún èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan padà.','Update the glossary'=>'Ṣe imudojuiwọn atumọ ede','Replaces the parts of the glossary you send (words never translated, term translations, tone); parts you leave out are kept. Used by every engine from the next translation on.'=>'Ó ń rọ́pò àwọn apá atúmọ̀-èdè tí ẹ fi ránṣẹ́ (àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ tí a kò túmọ̀ rí, àwọn ìtumọ̀ ọ̀rọ̀, ohùn); àwọn apá tí ẹ fi sílẹ̀ ni a ó pa mọ́. Gbogbo ẹ̀rọ ni yóò máa lò ó bẹ̀rẹ̀ láti orí ìtumọ̀ tí ń bọ̀ lọ.','Language suggestion'=>'Àbá èdè','This page is also available in %s.'=>'Ojú-ewé yìí tún wà ní %s.','Read it in %s'=>'Ka á ní %s','No thanks'=>'Rárá, o ṣeun','Choose how languages appear in your addresses: a folder, a subdomain, a separate domain or a query parameter.'=>'Yan bi awọn ede yoo ṣe han ninu awọn adirẹsi rẹ: folda kan, agbegbe kekere kan, agbegbe ọtọtọ tabi paramita ibeere kan.','Subdomains and separate domains per language are part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Àwọn abẹ́-orúkọ-ààyè àti àwọn orúkọ-ààyè ọ̀tọ̀ọ̀tọ̀ fún èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan jẹ́ apá kan ti Tranzly Pro.','The language folders must be a list.'=>'Awọn folda ede gbọdọ jẹ atokọ kan.','"%s" cannot be a language folder. Use 2 to 12 lowercase letters, digits or hyphens, different for every language, and not a word WordPress already uses.'=>'"%s" kò lè jẹ́ àpò èdè. Lo àwọn lẹ́tà kékeré, àwọn nọ́mbà tàbí àwọn àmì ìdáwọ́rọ̀ 2 sí 12, tí ó yàtọ̀ fún gbogbo èdè, tí kò sì jẹ́ ọ̀rọ̀ tí WordPress ti ń lò tẹ́lẹ̀.','The domains must be a list.'=>'Awọn orukọ agbegbe gbọdọ jẹ akojọ kan.','"%s" is not a domain name, such as example.de.'=>'"%s" kii ṣe orukọ agbegbe, gẹgẹbi example.de.','Each language needs its own domain.'=>'Èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan nílò agbègbè tiwọn fúnra wọn.','The translated address words must be a list.'=>'Awọn ọrọ adirẹsi ti a tumọ gbọdọ jẹ atokọ.','The translated address words must be listed per language.'=>'Awọn ọrọ adirẹsi ti a tumọ gbọdọ wa ni akojọ fun ede kọọkan.','"%s" cannot be used in an address. Use lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'A ko le lo "%s" ninu adirẹsi kan. Lo awọn lẹta kekere, awọn nọmba ati awọn ami-idapọ.','This setting is on or off.'=>'Ètò yìí wà ní títàn tàbí pípa.','Hiding untranslated pages from search engines is part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Fifi awọn oju-iwe ti a ko tumọ pamọ kuro lọwọ awọn ẹrọ iṣawari jẹ apakan ti Tranzly Pro.','Languages (as a submenu)'=>'Àwọn èdè','Languages (side by side)'=>'Àwọn èdè (ní ẹ̀gbẹ́ kọ̀ọ̀kan)','Add to Menu'=>'Ṣafikun si Akojọ aṣyn','On your site, this item shows the site\'s languages, each linking to the current page in that language.'=>'Lori aaye rẹ, nkan yii n ṣe afihan awọn ede aaye naa, ti ọkọọkan wọn si n sopọ si oju-iwe lọwọlọwọ ni ede yẹn.','%1$s (%2$d)'=>'%1$s (%2$d)','Links to this page in each of your languages.'=>'Àwọn ọ̀nà àsopọ̀ sí ojú-ewé yìí ní èkọ̀ọ̀kan àwọn èdè yín.','Language name'=>'Orúkọ èdè','Language code'=>'Kóòdù èdè','Name and code'=>'Orukọ ati koodu','Design'=>'Àwòrán','Show each language as'=>'Ṣe afihan ede kọọkan bi','Show flags (a flag is a country, not a language)'=>'Fi àwọn àsíá hàn (àsíá jẹ́ orílẹ̀-èdè, kì í ṣe èdè)','List'=>'Àkójọ','Pills'=>'Awọn egbogi','Buttons'=>'Àwọn bọ́tìnì','Dropdown'=>'Àkójọ àṣàyàn','Language codes'=>'Àwọn kóòdù èdè','Flags'=>'Àwọn Àmì','Include the current language'=>'Pẹlu èdè lọwọlọwọ','Hide languages this page is not translated into'=>'Tọ́jú àwọn èdè tí a kò ṣe ògbufọ̀ ojúewé yìí sí','Stack vertically'=>'Tò lórí ara wọn ní inaro','Accessible label'=>'Aami wiwọle','Text'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀','Background'=>'Abẹ́lẹ̀','Current language text'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ èdè lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́','Current language background'=>'Àyíká èdè lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́','Border'=>'Aala','Corner radius'=>'Ìwọ̀n igun','Space between languages'=>'Àyè láàrín àwọn èdè','Text size'=>'Ìwọ̀n àkọsílẹ̀','Switcher'=>'Olùyípadà','(no title)'=>'(kò sí àkọlé)','There is nothing to fix here.'=>'Kò sí ohun tí a lè túnṣe níhìn-ín.','No content type is translated on this site.'=>'Kò sí irú àkóónú kankan tí a túmọ̀ lórí ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí.','That content type is not translated on this site.'=>'Irú àkóónú yẹn kò ṣe é túmọ̀ lórí ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí.','There is nothing to translate in that selection.'=>'Kò sí ohun kankan láti túmọ̀ nínú àṣàyàn yẹn.','Choose at least one language to translate into.'=>'Yan o kere ju ede kan lati se itumo si.','You are not allowed to export translations.'=>'A kò fún yín láàyè láti gbé àwọn ìyípadà èdè jáde.','Choose an XLIFF or CSV file to import.'=>'Yan faili XLIFF tabi CSV lati ko wọle.','That is not a Tranzly XLIFF or CSV file. Export one first, translate it, and import it here.'=>'Iyẹn kii ṣe faili Tranzly XLIFF tabi CSV kan. Kọkọ gbe ọkan jade, tumọ rẹ, ki o si gbe e wọle si ibi.','The file could not be stored for importing. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'A ko le fi faili naa pamo fun kiko wole. Yewo boya a le ko sinu folda awon ifiweranṣẹ.','That import is not there any more. Upload the file again.'=>'Ìgbéwọlé yẹn kò sí mọ́. Tún fáìlì náà gbéwọlé.','That page is not on this site any more.'=>'Oju-iwe yẹn ko si lori aaye yii mọ.','The file is for a language this site does not have.'=>'Fáìlì náà wà fún èdè tí ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí kò ní.','Could not link %1$s %2$d: %3$s'=>'Kò le so %1$s %2$d pọ̀: %3$s','Post #%1$d: %2$s'=>'Àkọsílẹ̀ #%1$d: %2$s','No data from that plugin was found on this site.'=>'A kò rí dátà kankan láti inú àfikún yẹn lórí ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí.','This is not a translation of anything on this site.'=>'Èyí kìí ṣe ìtúmọ̀ ohunkóhun lórí ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí.','There is no text to check.'=>'Kò sí àkọsílẹ̀ kankan láti ṣàyẹ̀wò.','The AI settings are not part of this build.'=>'Àwọn ètò AI kì í ṣe apá kan ìkọ́lé yìí.','The AI provider did not answer.'=>'Olupese AI ko dahun.','The AI model did not score every part of this page. Try again, or choose another model.'=>'Awoṣe AI ko ṣe ikunsinu gbogbo apakan ti oju-iwe yii. Gbiyanju lẹẹkansi, tabi yan awoṣe miiran.','Translator'=>'Olùgbédèkalẹ̀','Translation reviewer'=>'Olùtúwò ìtúmọ̀-èdè','A reviewer asked for changes to this translation.'=>'Olùtúnyẹ̀wò kan béèrè fún àwọn àtúnṣe sí ìyípadà èdè yìí.','A reviewer asked for changes to this translation: %s'=>'Olùṣàyẹ̀wò kan bèrè fún àwọn àyípadà sí ìyípadà-èdè yìí: %s','This translation is waiting for a reviewer. Publishing it (as a reviewer) approves it.'=>'Ìtúmọ̀ yìí ń dúró de olùṣàyẹ̀wò kan. Títẹ̀ ẹ́ jáde (gẹ́gẹ́ bí olùṣàyẹ̀wò) ń fọwọ́ sí i.','Only a translation can be reviewed.'=>'Itumọ nikan ni a le ṣe ayẹwo.','Choose what happens when an original changes: nothing, mark its translations out of date, or translate them again.'=>'Yan ohun ti yoo ṣẹlẹ nigbati atilẹba ba yipada: ko si nkankan, samisi awọn itumọ rẹ bi ti igba atijọ, tabi tun tumọ wọn.','The quality threshold is a score from 0 to 100.'=>'Opo-ọrọ didara jẹ ami-eye lati 0 si 100.','Show hidden suggestions on the Overview again'=>'Tun fi awọn aba ti o pamọ han lori Akopọ lẹẹkansi','All'=>'Gbogbo rẹ̀','%d selected'=>'A yan %d','Nothing matches.'=>'Kò sí ohun tó bá a mu.','Select all on this page'=>'Yan gbogbo rẹ lori oju-iwe yii','Select'=>'Yan','Pages'=>'Àwọn Ojú-ewé','Previous'=>'Ti tẹ́lẹ̀','Page %1$d of %2$d'=>'Ojú-ewé %1$d nínú %2$d','Set up %s in a few minutes'=>'Ṣeto %s laarin iṣẹju diẹ','Start setup'=>'Bẹ̀rẹ̀ ìṣètò','This site'=>'Aaye yii','Edition'=>'Àtúnse','Sites on this licence'=>'Àwọn ojúlé lórí ìwé-àṣẹ yìí','Version'=>'Àtúnṣe','This looks like a staging or local copy, so it does not use up a site on your licence.'=>'Èyí dàbí àdákọ ìdánwò tàbí ti orí ẹ̀rọ, nítorí náà kò lo àyè lórí ìwé-àṣẹ yín.','See what Pro adds'=>'Wo ohun tí Pro ń fi kún un','Go to'=>'Lọ sí','Personal'=>'Ti ara ẹni','Business'=>'Iṣowo','Agency'=>'Ile-iṣẹ','Any number of sites'=>'Iye àwọn ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù èyíkéyìí','Unlimited sites'=>'Àwọn ojúlé ayélujára aláìlópin','%d site'=>'ojúlé %d','Pro'=>'Pro','%s trial'=>'Idanwo %s','Your trial has started. Reload the page to see every Pro feature.'=>'Idanwo rẹ ti bẹrẹ. Tun oju-iwe naa gbe lati wo gbogbo ẹya Pro.','The trial could not be started.'=>'A ko le bẹrẹ idanwo naa.','Feature'=>'Àfihàn','Included'=>'Ti pẹlu','Not included'=>'A ko pẹlu rẹ','Your licence'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ rẹ','%1$d of %2$d in use'=>'%1$d ninu %2$d ni a nlo','Renews'=>'Ń sọ di ọ̀tun','Staging, test and localhost copies of a site are free and never count toward your site limit.'=>'Àwọn ẹ̀dà staging, ìdánwò àti localhost ti ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù kan jẹ́ ọ̀fẹ́, wọn kì í sì í kà mọ́ ààlà ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù rẹ.','Your plan includes priority support.'=>'Ètò rẹ pẹ̀lú àtìlẹ́yìn àkọ́kọ́.','Manage your licence and billing'=>'Ṣakoso iwe-aṣẹ ati ìsanwó rẹ','Get more with Pro'=>'Gba púpọ̀ sí i pẹ̀lú Pro','Start a free %d-day trial, no card needed'=>'Bẹrẹ idanwo ọfẹ ti ọjọ %d, ko nilo kaadi','See plans and prices'=>'Wo àwọn ètò àti iye owó','Use Tranzly and Page Builder Sandwich together? The bundle includes both Pro plugins for less.'=>'Ṣe o nlo Tranzly ati Page Builder Sandwich papọ? Apo naa pẹlu awọn afikun Pro mejeeji fun iye owo ti o kere si.','Your licence has expired. Renew it to keep getting updates and Pro features.'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ rẹ ti pari. Sọ ọ di ọtun lati tesiwaju lati gba awọn imudojuiwọn ati awọn ẹya Pro.','Renew now'=>'Sọ di ọ̀tun báyìí','Compare the plans'=>'Ṣe afiwe awọn eto','Search features'=>'Ṣawari awọn ẹya ara ẹrọ','Area'=>'Agbègbè','Included in'=>'Ti o wa ninu','No feature matches.'=>'Kò sí àbùdá tó bá a mu.','Features by plan'=>'Àwọn àbùdá nípasẹ̀ ètò','Hide'=>'Farasin','Activate it on the Plugins screen'=>'Muu ṣiṣẹ lori oju-iboju Awọn ohun-itanna','Install it'=>'Fi sori ẹrọ','Overview'=>'Akopọ','Setup'=>'Ìṣètò','Plans and licence'=>'Àwọn ètò àti ìwé àṣẹ','Add-ons'=>'Àwọn àfikún','Get help'=>'Gba ìrànlọ́wọ́','Feedback'=>'Esi','Your choice could not be saved.'=>'A ko le fi yiyan rẹ pamọ.','The setup state could not be saved.'=>'Kò le ṣe ìtọ́jú ipò ìṣètò náà.','Match my computer'=>'Bá kọ̀ǹpútà mi mu','Light'=>'Fẹ́rẹ́','Dark'=>'Dúdú','Colour scheme'=>'Ètò àwọ̀','Help'=>'Ìrànwọ́','Guide to this screen'=>'Itọsọna sí ojú-ìwòye yìí','Take the tour'=>'Bẹrẹ irin-ajo itọsọna','Get help or report a bug'=>'Gba iranlọwọ tabi jabo aṣiṣe kan','Plugin screens'=>'Àwọn ojú-ìbòjú àfikún','That could not be saved.'=>'A ko le fi iyẹn pamọ́.','Before you contact support'=>'Kí o tó kàn sí àtìlẹ́yìn','Your request is sent from this site to %s, who make this plugin. We send:'=>'A fi ibeere rẹ ranṣẹ lati aaye yii si %s, ti o ṣe afikun yii. A n fi ranṣẹ:','your e-mail address and name, so we can reply;'=>'àdírẹ́ẹ̀sì e-mail àti orúkọ rẹ, kí a lè fèsì;','the subject and message you write;'=>'kókó-ọ̀rọ̀ àti iṣẹ́-ìránṣẹ́ tí ẹ kọ;','your licence ID, so paying customers get priority;'=>'ID iwe-aṣẹ rẹ, ki awọn alabara ti n sanwo le gba pataki;','only if you tick it: site details (WordPress and PHP versions, theme, plugins, an excerpt of the error log with passwords and e-mail addresses removed), which you can read before sending;'=>'ti o ba sami si nikan: awọn alaye aaye (awọn ẹya WordPress ati PHP, akori, awọn afikun, apakan ti akọọlẹ aṣiṣe pẹlu awọn ọrọigbaniwọle ati awọn adirẹsi imeeli ti a yọ kuro), eyiti o le ka ṣaaju fifiranṣẹ;','Privacy policy'=>'Ilana àbò','I agree, continue'=>'Mo gba, tẹsiwaju','The connection could not be checked.'=>'A ko le ṣayẹwo àsopọ̀ náà.','That did not work. Try again.'=>'Kò ṣiṣẹ́. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi.','Zinn Digital® support disconnected this site.'=>'Atilẹyin Zinn Digital® ti ge asopọ aaye yii.','Zinn Digital® support no longer recognises this site.'=>'Atilẹyin Zinn Digital® kò mọ aaye yii mọ.','You disconnected this site.'=>'O ti ge asopọ aaye yii.','Connect this site to support'=>'So aaye yii pọ mọ atilẹyin','Connected. Replies go to %s.'=>'Ti sopọ. Awọn idahun yoo lọ si %s.','Not connected. You can still send a request with your e-mail address below; connecting saves typing it each time.'=>'Kò sopọ̀. O ṣì lè fi ìbéèrè ránṣẹ́ pẹ̀lú àdírẹ́sì e-mail rẹ ní ìsàlẹ̀; sísopọ̀ ń dín kíkọ ọ́ ní gbogbo ìgbà kù.','E-mail address'=>'Àdírẹ́ẹ̀sì e-mail','Your name (optional)'=>'Orukọ rẹ (aṣayan)','I agree to connect this site to Zinn Digital® support. It sends this site’s address, WordPress and PHP versions and the plugin version, and can be disconnected at any time from here or by Zinn Digital®.'=>'Mo gba lati so aaye yii pọ mọ atilẹyin Zinn Digital®. O n fi adirẹsi aaye yii, awọn ẹya WordPress ati PHP ati ẹya plug-in ranṣẹ, ati pe a le ge asopọ rẹ nigbakugba lati ibi tabi nipasẹ Zinn Digital®.','Connect'=>'Sopọ','I need help'=>'Mo nílò ìrànwọ́','Report a bug'=>'Ròyìn àṣìṣe kan','Send feedback'=>'Fi èsì ránṣẹ́','Request a feature'=>'Béèrè fún àbùdá kan','The site details could not be read.'=>'A ko le ka àwọn kúlẹ̀kúlẹ̀ ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù náà.','Your request could not be sent. Try again in a few minutes.'=>'A kò le fi ìbéèrè rẹ ránṣẹ́. Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi lẹ́yìn ìṣẹ́jú díẹ̀.','Feedback and feature requests'=>'Èsì àti àwọn ìbéèrè fún àwọn àbùdá','Sent. Your reference is %s, and our reply will come by e-mail.'=>'A ti fi ránṣẹ́. Nọ́ńbà ìtọ́kasí rẹ ni %s, èsì wa yóò sì wá nípasẹ̀ e-mail.','What is it about?'=>'Kí ni ó dá lé lórí?','Reply to (e-mail)'=>'Fèsì sí (imeeli)','Subject'=>'Kókó-ọ̀rọ̀','What did you do, what did you expect, and what happened instead?'=>'Kí ni ẹ ṣe, kí ni ẹ nireti, kí ni ó sì ṣẹlẹ̀ dípò rẹ̀?','Include site details (versions, theme, plugins, error log excerpt)'=>'Pẹ̀lú àwọn kúlẹ́kúlẹ́ ojúlé (àwọn àtẹ̀jáde, àwọ̀, àwọn àfikún, àyọkà àkọsílẹ̀ àṣìṣe)','See exactly what is sent'=>'Wo gangan ohun ti a firanṣẹ','Loading…'=>'Ń gbé wọlé…','Send'=>'Firanṣẹ','Step %1$d of %2$d'=>'Ìgbésẹ̀ %1$d nínú %2$d','Close the tour'=>'Pa ìbẹ̀wò náà dé','Back'=>'Pada sẹ́yìn','Everything in one place'=>'Gbogbo nǹkan ní ojú kan','These tabs lead to every screen of the plugin: setup, settings, your licence, help and more.'=>'Àwọn táàbù wọ̀nyí ń darí sí gbogbo ojú-ìwé ti àfikún náà: ìṣètò, àwọn ètò, ìwé-àṣẹ yín, ìrànwọ́ àti púpọ̀ síi.','Help on every screen'=>'Ìrànlọ́wọ́ lórí gbogbo ojú-ìbòjú','Open this menu for the guide to the screen you are on, this tour, or to ask us for help.'=>'Ṣí àkójọ-ẹ̀yà yìí fún ìtọ́sọ́nà sí ojú-ìbòjú tí o wà lórí rẹ̀, ìrìn-àbẹ̀wò yìí, tàbí láti tọrọ ìrànlọ́wọ́ lọ́wọ́ wa.','Light or dark'=>'Fẹ́lẹ́fẹ́lẹ́ tàbí dúdú','Choose light, dark, or the same as your computer. Your choice is remembered for you only.'=>'Yan ìmọ́lẹ̀, òkùnkùn, tàbí bákan náà pẹ̀lú kọ̀ǹpútà rẹ. Ìyàn rẹ ni a máa rántí fún ìwọ nìkan.','Welcome'=>'Ẹ káàbọ̀','This short tour shows where things are. You can leave it at any time with Escape.'=>'Ìrìn-àbẹ̀wò kúkúrú yìí ń fi ibi tí àwọn nǹkan wà hàn. O le jáde kúrò níbẹ̀ nígbàkúgbà pẹ̀lú Escape.','Your site at a glance'=>'Ojú-ìwé wẹ́ẹ̀bù yín ní sọ́kí','Setup progress and your plan are shown here, with the next thing worth doing.'=>'Ìtẹ̀síwájú ìtòlẹ́sẹẹsẹ àti ètò rẹ ni a fihàn níbí, pẹ̀lú ohun tó tẹ̀lé e tí ó yẹ kí a ṣe.','Your plan, how many sites it covers, and whether this copy of the site counts toward that limit.'=>'Ètò rẹ, iye àwọn ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù tí ó ní nínú, àti bóyá ẹ̀dà ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí wà lára ààlà yẹn.','Try Pro or upgrade'=>'Gbiyanju Pro tabi ṣe igbesoke','Start a free trial without a card, upgrade, or renew, all from here.'=>'Bẹrẹ idanwo ọfẹ laisi kaadi, ṣe igbesoke, tabi sọ di ọtun, gbogbo rẹ lati ibi.','Every feature and the plan that includes it. Search for a feature or show one area at a time.'=>'Gbogbo ẹya ati ètò ti o pẹlu rẹ. Ṣe àwárí fún ẹya kan tabi ṣafihan agbegbe kan ni akoko kan.','More from Zinn Digital®'=>'Diẹ sii lati Zinn Digital®','Plugins that work with this one, and services from the same team. Cards you hid on other screens can be shown again here.'=>'Àwọn ohun-ìfikún tí ń ṣiṣẹ́ pẹ̀lú èyí, àti àwọn iṣẹ́ láti ọ̀dọ̀ ẹgbẹ́ kan náà. Àwọn káàdì tí o fi pamọ́ sí àwọn ojú-ìbòjú míràn ni a lè tún fi hàn níhìn-ín.','Connect for faster help'=>'Sopọ fun iranlọwọ ti o yara sii','Connecting is optional. It lets you send requests without typing your e-mail each time, and you can disconnect whenever you like.'=>'Sísopọ̀ jẹ́ àṣàyàn. Ó ń jẹ́ kí ẹ fi àwọn ìbéèrè ránṣẹ́ láìsí kíkọ lẹ́tà-ẹ̀rọ yín ní gbogbo ìgbà, ẹ sì lè já a kúrò nígbàkúgbà tí ẹ bá fẹ́.','Ask for help or report a bug'=>'Béèrè fún ìrànwọ́ tàbí ròyìn àṣìṣe','Describe what happened. You choose whether to attach site information, and you can see exactly what it contains first.'=>'Ṣàpèjúwe ohun tó ṣẹlẹ̀. Ìwọ ló máa yan bóyá láti so ìwífún ojú-òpó mọ́ ọn, o sì lè kọ́kọ́ rí ohun gangan tó wà nínú rẹ̀.','Tell us what to build'=>'Sọ ohun ti a o kọ fun wa','Send an idea, a feature request or any feedback. It goes straight to the team.'=>'Fi èrò, ìbéèrè fún àfikún tàbí èsì èyíkéyìí ránṣẹ́. Ó ń lọ tààràtà sí ọ̀dọ̀ ẹgbẹ́ náà.','This takes a few minutes and sets up %s so it works on this site straight away. You can change everything later.'=>'Eyi gba iṣẹju diẹ ati ṣeto %s ki o le ṣiṣẹ lori aaye yii lẹsẹkẹsẹ. O le yi ohun gbogbo pada nigbamii.','You are ready. If anything does not work as expected, we are one click away.'=>'O ti ṣe tán. Bí ohunkóhun kò bá ṣiṣẹ́ bí a ti retí rẹ̀, a wà ní tẹ́tẹ́ kan péré sí ọ.','Step %1$d of %2$d: %3$s'=>'Ìgbésẹ̀ %1$d nínú %2$d: %3$s','Finish'=>'Pari','Skip setup'=>'Fò ìṣètò','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Itumọ rẹ jẹ kikọ nipasẹ Neil Lock, Alakoso ti Zinn Digital® Ltd','Version %s'=>'Àtúnṣe %s','Tranzly website'=>'Oju opo wẹẹbu Tranzly','Zinn Digital® website'=>'Oju opo wẹẹbu Zinn Digital®','Installing WordPress\'s own words for this language in the background.'=>'Fifi àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ WordPress fúnra rẹ̀ sori ẹ̀rọ fún èdè yìí ní abẹ́lẹ̀.','WordPress\'s own words are installed for this language (and %d plugin and theme translations).'=>'A ti fi àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ WordPress fúnra rẹ̀ sórí ẹ̀rọ fún èdè yìí (àti àwọn ìtumọ̀ àfikún àti àkòrí %d).','Plugin and theme words are installed; WordPress.org has no translation of WordPress itself for this language yet.'=>'A ti fi àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ àfikún àti àkòrí sípò; WordPress.org kò tíì ní ìyípadà èdè fún WordPress fúnra rẹ̀ fún èdè yìí.','WordPress.org has no translation of WordPress\'s own words for this language yet.'=>'WordPress.org kò tíì ní ìtúmọ̀ àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ WordPress fún èdè yìí.','This site does not allow installing translations (file changes are switched off), so WordPress\'s own words stay in English for this language.'=>'Aaye yii ko gba laaye fifi awọn itumọ sii (a ti pa awọn iyipada faili), nitorinaa awọn ọrọ ti WordPress funra rẹ wa ni ede Gẹẹsi fun ede yii.','Settings saved.'=>'A ti fi àwọn ètò pamọ́.','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'Wo àwọn ètò Pro àti iye owó wọn','Languages'=>'Àwọn èdè','The first language is the one your content is written in. Visitors switch with the language switcher block.'=>'Èdè àkọ́kọ́ ni èyí tí a kọ àkóónú yín sí. Àwọn àlejò máa ń yí padà pẹ̀lú búlọ́ọ̀kì olùyípadà èdè.','(default)'=>'(àkànṣe)','Find a language'=>'Wa èdè kan','Type its name in your language or in its own, then choose it. The code and name below fill in by themselves.'=>'Tẹ orúkọ rẹ̀ ní èdè rẹ tàbí ní èdè tirẹ̀, lẹ́yìn náà yàn án. Àmì-ọ̀rọ̀ àti orúkọ tí ó wà nísàlẹ̀ yóò kún fúnra wọn.','Locale code'=>'Koodu ibilẹ','For example fr_FR'=>'Fún àpẹẹrẹ fr_FR','Name (optional)'=>'Orukọ (àṣàyàn)','For example Français'=>'Fún àpẹẹrẹ Français','Add language'=>'Ṣafikun èdè','Front-end output'=>'Abajade iwaju','Class name prefix'=>'Àlẹ̀mọ́wájú orúkọ kíláàsì','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Gbogbo orúkọ kíláàsì tí àfikún náà ń tẹ̀ sí àwọn ojú-ìwé rẹ ń bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú àlẹ̀mọ́-iwaju yìí, kí àwọn ojú-ìwé náà má baà fi hàn pé àfikún wo ló kọ́ wọn. Lẹ́tà kékeré tàbí nọ́mbà 1 sí 8, tí ó bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú lẹ́tà kan.','Beta updates'=>'Àwọn àmúgbégà beta','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Aaye yii ngba awọn ẹya beta bi awọn imudojuiwọn.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Aaye yii n gba awọn ẹya ti o duro ṣinṣin nikan.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Yi eyi pada lori oju-iwe Akanti','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'A ń pèsè àwọn ẹ̀dà Beta fún àwọn ìfìsípò Pro tó ní ìwé àṣẹ tí a ti so pọ̀ mọ́ àkọọ́lẹ̀ wọn. Ní kété tí a bá ti so ó pọ̀, ẹ lè dara pọ̀ láti ojú-ewé Àkọọ́lẹ̀.','Save settings'=>'Fipamọ́ àwọn ètò','First engine that is set up'=>'Ẹnjini akọkọ ti a ṣeto','Key saved. It is stored encrypted and never shown again.'=>'A ti fi kọkọrọ pamọ́. A tọ́jú rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú ààbò ìyípada-àkọsílẹ̀ bẹ́ẹ̀ ni a kì yóò fi hàn mọ́ láéláé.','Engine settings saved.'=>'A ti fi àwọn ètò ẹ̀rọ pamọ́.','Glossary saved.'=>'A ti fi ìwé atúmọ̀-èdè pamọ́.','Your keys'=>'Àwọn kókó rẹ','Tranzly calls the translation services with your own account. Keys are stored encrypted in your database and are only ever sent to the service they belong to. AI model keys are set in the AI settings.'=>'Tranzly ń pe àwọn iṣẹ́ ìtumọ̀ pẹ̀lú àkọọ́lẹ̀ tirẹ̀ fúnra rẹ. Àwọn kókó-ọ̀rọ̀ ti wà ní fipamọ́ pẹ̀lú ìbòjú nínú àbọ́-ìpìlẹ̀ data rẹ, a sì máa ń fi wọ́n ránṣẹ́ sí iṣẹ́ tí wọ́n jẹ́ mọ́ nìkan. A ń ṣètò àwọn kókó-ọ̀rọ̀ àwòṣe AI nínú àwọn ètò AI.','%s API key'=>'Kókó API %s','Saved: %s. Enter a new key to replace it, or save an empty field to remove it.'=>'Ti fipamọ́: %s. Tẹ kọ́kọ́rọ́ tuntun kan sii lati rọ́pò rẹ̀, tabi fipamọ́ pápá ti ko ni nkan ninu lati yọ ọ́ kuro.','No key saved.'=>'Kò sí kókóró tí a fipamọ́.','Azure region (leave empty for a global resource)'=>'Agbègbè Azure (fi sílẹ̀ ní òfo fún orísun àgbáyé)','Save key'=>'Fi kọ́kọ́rọ́ pamọ́','Check my DeepL usage'=>'Ṣayẹwo lilo DeepL mi','%1$s of %2$s characters used this billing period.'=>'A ti lo %1$s ninu awọn ami %2$s fun akoko isanwo yii.','Which engine translates'=>'Èrọ wo ló ń túmọ̀','No engine is set up yet. Save a key above (or set up an AI model) to start translating.'=>'Kò tíì sí ẹ̀rọ kankan tí a gbé kalẹ̀. Fi kókó pamọ́ sí òkè (tàbí gbé àwòṣe AI kalẹ̀) láti bẹ̀rẹ̀ sí ní ṣe ìyípadà èdè.','Default engine'=>'Ẹnjini aiyipada','A different engine or AI model per language, automatic fallback and monthly spending caps are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'Ẹnjini tabi awoṣe AI ọtọọtọ fun ede kọọkan, aṣayan ifasẹyin laifọwọyi ati awọn opin inawo oṣooṣu jẹ awọn ẹya ara ẹrọ Tranzly Pro.','Glossary and words never translated'=>'Atúmọ̀-èdè àti àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ tí a kò ní túmọ̀ láé','Never translate these words (one per line)'=>'Má ṣe túmọ̀ àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ wọ̀nyí láé (ọ̀kan ní ìlà kọ̀ọ̀kan)','Brand and product names stay exactly as they are, with every engine.'=>'Àwọn orúkọ àmì-ìdánimọ̀ àti ọjà wà gẹ́gẹ́ bí wọ́n ṣe wà pẹ́kí, pẹ̀lú gbogbo ẹ̀rọ.','Preferred translations and tone per language are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'Awọn itumọ ti a fẹran ati ohun orin fun ede kọọkan jẹ awọn ẹya ara ẹrọ Tranzly Pro.','Save glossary'=>'Fi àkójọ ọ̀rọ̀ pamọ́','Settings'=>'Àwọn Ètò','Translation engine'=>'Ẹnjini ìyípadà èdè','What Tranzly translates on this site'=>'Kí ni Tranzly ń ṣe ìtúmọ̀ rẹ̀ lórí ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí','found, translated with your content'=>'ti a ri, ti a tumọ pẹlu akoonu rẹ','not on this site'=>'kò sí lórí ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí','With Tranzly Pro: Elementor, Bricks, Divi, Beaver Builder, Oxygen and WPBakery pages; everything in WooCommerce, with prices in the visitor’s currency; the SEO fields of Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress and All in One SEO; ACF, Meta Box and Pods fields; forms and their e-mails; your theme’s and plugins’ own text; and comments and reviews.'=>'Pẹ̀lú Tranzly Pro: àwọn ojú-ìwé Elementor, Bricks, Divi, Beaver Builder, Oxygen àti WPBakery; gbogbo nǹkan nínú WooCommerce, pẹ̀lú àwọn iye owó nínú owó ti olùbẹ̀wò náà ń lò; àwọn pápá SEO ti Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress àti All in One SEO; àwọn pápá ACF, Meta Box àti Pods; àwọn fọ́ọ̀mù àti àwọn e-mail wọn; àkọlé ti kókó àti àwọn plugin yín fúnra wọn; àti àwọn àwíyé àti àtúnyẹ̀wò.','Shop text and e-mails'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ ile-itaja ati awọn imeeli','E-mail subjects and headings, payment and shipping method names, and the checkout notices. Each order’s e-mails go out in the language it was placed in.'=>'Àwọn orúkọ kókó-ọ̀rọ̀ àti àkọlé e-mail, àwọn orúkọ ọ̀nà ìsanwó àti ìfiránṣẹ́, àti àwọn àkíyèsí ìsanwó-ìparí. Àwọn e-mail ti àṣẹ kọ̀ọ̀kan máa ń jáde ní èdè tí a fi gbé e kalẹ̀.','Forms and their e-mails'=>'Àwọn fọ́ọ̀mù àti àwọn lẹ́tà-ẹ̀lẹ́tirọ́ọ̀nì wọn','Every form keeps one list of entries; its labels, buttons, messages and e-mails appear in the visitor’s language.'=>'Fọọmu kọọkan n tọju akojọ awọn titẹ sii kan; awọn aami rẹ, awọn bọtini, awọn ifiranṣẹ ati awọn imeeli n han ni ede alejo.','Saved.'=>'Ti fipamọ́.','No ACF, Meta Box or Pods fields are defined yet.'=>'A kò tíì ṣàlàyé àwọn pápá ACF, Meta Box tàbí Pods kankan.','Field'=>'Pápá','Where'=>'Nibo','In a translation'=>'Ninu itumọ','What happens to %s in a translation'=>'Kí ló ń ṣẹlẹ̀ sí %s nínú ìtúmọ̀','Translate it'=>'Túmọ̀ ọ́n','Copy it as it is'=>'Dàakọ rẹ bí ó ṣe wà','Leave it empty'=>'Fi silẹ ni ofifo','The shop’s currency'=>'Owo ile-itaja','Currencies'=>'Àwọn owó','Show prices in other currencies (the shop’s own is %s)'=>'Ṣe afihan awọn idiyele ni awọn owo nina miiran (ti ile itaja funrarẹ jẹ %s)','Exchange rates'=>'Awọn oṣuwọn paṣipaarọ','Rates last updated %s.'=>'A ṣe imudojuiwọn awọn oṣuwọn kẹhin ni %s.','Rates have not been fetched yet.'=>'A kò tíì gba àwọn oye náà wọlé.','Update the rates now'=>'Ṣe imudojuiwọn awọn oṣuwọn ni bayi','New currency'=>'Owó tuntun','Choose…'=>'Yan…','Rate (per 1 %s)'=>'Oṣuwọn (fun 1 %s)','Typing a rate keeps it: the daily update will not change it.'=>'Kíkọ oṣuwọn kan yoo tọ́jú rẹ̀: ìmúdàgbàsókè ojoojúmọ́ kò ní yí i padà.','Rounding'=>'Ìṣirò sí nọ́mbà tó súnmọ́','None'=>'Kò sí','Round up'=>'Ṣe àkópọ̀ sí òkè','Round to the nearest'=>'Ṣe àyípadà sí èyí tí ó súnmọ́ jù','Round down'=>'Ṣe àkópọ̀ sí ìsàlẹ̀','Round to (for example 1, 0.05 or 10)'=>'Ṣe àyípadà sí (fún àpẹẹrẹ 1, 0.05 tàbí 10)','Prices end in (for example 0.99)'=>'Awọn idiyele pari si (fun apẹẹrẹ 0.99)','Add a currency'=>'Fi owó kún un','Which visitors see which currency'=>'Awọn alejo wo ni wọn n wo iru owo wo','By country: two-letter country code (for example CH)'=>'Nípa orílẹ̀-èdè: kóòdù orílẹ̀-èdè oní lẹ́tà méjì (fún àpẹẹrẹ CH)','Visitors from %s'=>'Àwọn àlejò láti %s','Let visitors choose (shortcode [tranzly_currency_switcher])'=>'Gba awọn alejo laaye lati yan (koodu kukuru [tranzly_currency_switcher])','Prices now depend on a cookie or on the visitor’s country: make sure your page cache varies by the "tranzly_currency" cookie, or excludes shop pages.'=>'Awọn iye owo ti dale lori kuki kan tabi lori orilẹ-ede alejo ni bayi: rii daju pe kaṣe oju-iwe rẹ yatọ nipasẹ kuki "tranzly_currency", tabi ki o yọ awọn oju-iwe ile-itaja kuro.','Save currencies'=>'Fi àwọn owó pamọ́','The words your theme and plugins print themselves (buttons, labels). Read a theme or plugin once, then translate its text here; your translation wins over the plugin’s own.'=>'Àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ tí akori àti àwọn àfikún yín ń tẹ̀ jáde fúnra wọn (àwọn bọ́tìnì, àwọn àkléyìn). Ka akori tàbí àfikún kan lẹ́ẹ̀kan, lẹ́yìn náà túmọ̀ ọ̀rọ̀ rẹ̀ níhìn-ín; ìtúmọ̀ yín yóò borí ti àfikún náà fúnra rẹ̀.','%d texts'=>'%d àwọn ọ̀rọ̀','not read yet'=>'kò tíì kà á','Read again'=>'Kà á lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi','Read its text'=>'Ka ọ̀rọ̀ rẹ̀','Job started with %d translations to do. It runs in the background: you can close this page.'=>'Iṣẹ́ bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú àwọn ìtumọ̀ %d láti ṣe. Ó ń ṣiṣẹ́ lẹ́yìn: o lè ti ojú-ewé yìí.','Queued again.'=>'A tún ti tò lẹ́sẹẹsẹ.','Running'=>'Ó ń ṣiṣẹ́','Finished'=>'Pari','Set up a translation engine in the Engines tab first.'=>'Kọ́kọ́ ṣètò ẹ̀rọ ìyílédè nínú táàbù Àwọn Ẹ̀rọ náà.','Translate every'=>'Túmọ̀ gbogbo','Into'=>'Sinu','With'=>'Pẹlu','Each language’s own engine'=>'Ẹ́ńjìnnì ti èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan','Publish the translations (otherwise they are saved as drafts)'=>'Ṣe atẹjade awọn itumọ naa (ti ko ba ṣe bẹ wọn yoo wa ni fipamọ gẹgẹbi awọn apẹrẹ)','Estimate the cost'=>'Ṣe iṣiro iye owo naa','%1$d posts, %2$s characters. The price for this engine is not known in advance.'=>'Àwọn àtẹ̀jade %1$d, àwọn lẹ́tà %2$s. Iye owó fún ẹ̀rọ yìí kò mọ̀ tẹ́lẹ̀.','%1$d posts, %2$s characters: about $%3$s on your own account.'=>'Àwọn àtẹ̀jáde %1$d, àwọn lẹ́tà %2$s: nǹkan bí $%3$s lórí àkópọ̀ ti ara rẹ.','Start translating'=>'Bẹrẹ titumọ','Jobs'=>'Àwọn iṣẹ́','No translation jobs yet.'=>'Kò tíì sí àwọn iṣẹ́ ìyédèpadà.','Job %1$d — %2$s'=>'Iṣẹ́ %1$d — %2$s','%1$d of %2$d translated, %3$d failed, %4$d skipped (protected or already in that language)'=>'%1$d ninu %2$d ni a ti tumọ, %3$d kuna, %4$d ni a fo (ni aabo tabi tẹlẹ wa ni ede yẹn)','%1$s: %2$d translated by %3$s'=>'%1$s: %2$d ti a túmọ̀ nipasẹ %3$s','Stop this job'=>'Dá iṣẹ́ yìí dúró','See what failed and why'=>'Wo ohun tí kò yọrí sí rere àti ìdí rẹ̀','Content'=>'Àkóónú','Language'=>'Èdè','What went wrong'=>'Kí ló fà á','Fix it'=>'Ṣàtúnṣe rẹ̀','Retry with'=>'Gbiyanju lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi pẹ̀lú','The same engine'=>'Ẹnjini kanna','Retry'=>'Gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi','Translate by hand'=>'Fagbára pèlú ọwọ́ túmọ̀','Corrected by a person, protected'=>'Atunse lati owo eniyan, ni aabo','Translated by WordPress (language pack), at no cost. Type your own wording to use it instead.'=>'Ti a tumọ nipasẹ WordPress (ìdìpọ̀ èdè), laisi idiyele. Tẹ ọrọ ti ara rẹ lati lo dipo rẹ.','Menus saved.'=>'A ti fi àwọn akojọ-aṣayan pamọ́.','%d texts translated.'=>'Àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ %d tí a túmọ̀.','Saved. Your corrections are protected from machine translation.'=>'A ti fi pamọ́. A dáàbò bo àwọn àtúnṣe rẹ kúrò lọ́wọ́ ìtumọ̀ ẹ̀rọ.','The same menu, translated'=>'Mẹ́nù kan náà, tí a túmọ̀','A separate menu per language'=>'Akojọ aṣayan lọtọ fun ede kọọkan','By default each menu is translated: its links lead to the translated pages, with their titles. Choose a menu of its own for a language here instead.'=>'Nipa aiyipada a n tum akojọ aṣayan kọọkan: awọn ọna asopọ rẹ n tọka si awọn oju-iwe ti a tumọ, pẹlu awọn akọle wọn. Yan akojọ aṣayan tirẹ fun ede kan nibi dipo.','Shared text'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ tí a pín','Which text'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ wo','Menu labels'=>'Àwọn àlẹ̀mọ́ àkójọ aṣàyàn','Site title, tagline and widgets'=>'Àkọlé ojúlé wẹ́ẹ̀bù, ọ̀rọ̀ àmì àti àwọn wíjíìtì','Templates, headers, footers and patterns'=>'Àwọn tẹ́ńpílẹ́ẹ̀tì, àwọn àkọsorí, àwọn àkọsẹ́lẹ̀ àti àwọn àpẹẹrẹ','Translate the missing text'=>'Ṣe afikun itumọ ọrọ ti o nsọnu','There is no text to translate here.'=>'Kò sí ọ̀rọ̀ kankan láti túmọ̀ síhìn-ín.','Save corrections'=>'Fi àwọn àtúnṣe pamọ́','Languages and settings'=>'Àwọn èdè àti ètò','Engines'=>'Àwọn Ẹ́ńjìnnì','Translation jobs'=>'Àwọn iṣẹ́ ìyédèpadà','Addresses and SEO'=>'Àwọn àdírẹ́ẹ̀sì àti SEO','Language switchers'=>'Àwọn olùyí èdè padà','SEO audit'=>'Ayẹwo SEO','Menus and shared text'=>'Àwọn àtòjọ àti ọ̀rọ̀ pínpín','Integrations'=>'Awọn iṣọpọ','No meta description'=>'Kò sí àpèjúwe meta','A language version visitors cannot open (draft, private or password)'=>'Ẹ̀dà èdè kan tí àwọn àlejò kò lè ṣí (àkọsílẹ̀ àkọ́kọ́, àdáni tàbí tí ó ní ọ̀rọ̀ìgbaniwọlé)','The address still uses the original words'=>'Àdírẹ́ẹ̀sì náà ṣì ń lo àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ àtìbẹ̀rẹ̀','Still holds the original text'=>'Ṣì ń ṣe àmúlò àkọsílẹ̀ àkọ́kọ́','The multilingual SEO audit is part of Tranzly Pro. It finds missing meta descriptions, broken hreflang, untranslated addresses and duplicate content, per language.'=>'Ayẹwo SEO ti ọpọlọpọ ede jẹ apakan ti Tranzly Pro. O n wa awọn apejuwe meta ti o sonu, hreflang ti o bajẹ, awọn adirẹsi ti a ko tumọ ati akoonu ti o jọra, fun ede kọọkan.','Language to audit'=>'Èdè láti ṣe àyẹ̀wò','Run the audit'=>'Ṣiṣe ayẹwo naa','Check the next pages'=>'Ṣayẹwo awọn oju-iwe ti o tẹle','%1$d pages checked, %2$d problems found.'=>'A ti ṣayẹwo ojúewé %1$d, a rí ìṣòro %2$d.','The whole language has been checked.'=>'Gbogbo èdè náà ni a ti yẹ̀wò.','Page'=>'Oju-iwe','Problem'=>'Ìṣòro','Job %1$d started: %2$d pages are being translated in the background. Follow it in Translation jobs.'=>'Iṣẹ́ %1$d ti bẹ̀rẹ̀: a ń túmọ̀ àwọn ojú-ìwé %2$d ní abẹ́lẹ̀. Tẹ̀lé e nínú Àwọn iṣẹ́ ìtúmọ̀-èdè.','%d translations are being checked in the background. Scores appear here as they arrive.'=>'A ń yẹ %d ìtúmọ̀ wò lẹ́yìn ojú-iṣẹ́. Àwọn máàkì yóò máa hàn níhìn-ín bí wọ́n ṣe ń dé.','Missing'=>'Kò sí','Out of date'=>'Kọjá àsìkò','Translated'=>'Ti tumọ','Edited by a person'=>'Atunṣe nipasẹ eniyan kan','Machine translated'=>'A túmọ̀ pẹ̀lú ẹ̀rọ','Waiting for review'=>'Nduro de atunyẹwo','Needs a human look'=>'Nilo ayẹwo eniyan','Everything'=>'Gbogbo rẹ̀','Up to date'=>'Ti ode oni','Tranzly is still working out which older translations are out of date. The "out of date" numbers will grow while it does.'=>'Tranzly ṣi n ṣiṣẹ lọwọ lati mọ awọn itumọ agbalagba ti ko ti ba igba mu mọ. Awọn nọmba "ti ko ba igba mu" yoo ma pọ si bi o ti n ṣe eyi.','Content type'=>'Irú àkóónú','All content'=>'Gbogbo akoonu','Average quality'=>'Didara apapọ','%1$d translated (%2$d%%)'=>'A túmọ̀ %1$d (%2$d%%)','Show'=>'Fi hàn','Translate everything missing'=>'Ṣe itumọ gbogbo nkan ti o sonu','Update everything out of date'=>'Ṣe imudojuiwọn gbogbo nkan ti o ti kọja akoko','Check the quality with AI'=>'Ṣayẹwo didara pẹlu AI','Translate the low-scoring pages again'=>'Túmọ̀ àwọn ojú-ìwé tí àmì wọn kéré lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi','Nothing here.'=>'Kò sí ohunkóhun níhìn-ín.','Quality'=>'Didara','by a person'=>'nipasẹ eniyan kan','waiting for review'=>'Ń dúró de àtúnyẹ̀wò','Show more'=>'Fihan siwaju sii','Bulk translate the whole site (Pro)'=>'Ṣe itumọ gbogbo aaye lẹẹkan naa (Pro)','With Tranzly Pro, choose content types and languages, see the estimate, and translate the whole site in one go.'=>'Pẹlu Tranzly Pro, yan awọn iru akoonu ati awọn ede, wo iṣiro naa, ki o si tumọ gbogbo aaye naa lẹẹkan ṣoṣo.','%d background jobs started, one per language. Follow them in Translation jobs.'=>'Awọn iṣẹ abẹlẹ %d ti bẹrẹ, ọkan fun ede kọọkan. Tẹle wọn ninu Awọn iṣẹ itumọ.','Content types'=>'Àwọn irú àkóónú','What to translate'=>'Kí ni láti túmọ̀','Only what is missing'=>'Kiki ohun ti o sonu nikan','Only what is out of date'=>'Kiki ohun ti ko ba igba mu mo','Everything (pages edited by a person stay as they are)'=>'Gbogbo nkan (àwọn ojú-ìwé tí ènìyàn ṣàtúnṣe rẹ̀ yóò wà bí wọ́n ṣe wà)','Estimate'=>'Ìṣirò','%1$d pages, %2$s characters. This engine does not publish a price.'=>'Ojú-ìwé %1$d, àwọn lẹ́tà %2$s. Ẹ̀rọ yìí kì í tẹ iye owó jáde.','%1$d pages, %2$s characters, about $%3$s.'=>'ojúewé %1$d, àwọn lẹ́tà %2$s, nǹkan bí $%3$s.','Find a text'=>'Wa ọ̀rọ̀ kan','%d more: type in "Find a text" to narrow the list.'=>'%d diẹ sii: tẹ sinu "Find a text" lati dinku atokọ naa.','A small button in a corner of every page, on any theme, with no set-up.'=>'Bọ́tìnì kékeré kan ní igun ojú-ewé kọ̀ọ̀kan, lórí àkòrí èyíkéyìí, láìsí ìṣètò kankan.','Off'=>'Paa','Bottom corner, end side'=>'Kọ́ńdù ìsàlẹ̀, apá òpin','Bottom corner, start side'=>'Igun ìsàlẹ̀, ẹ̀gbẹ́ ìbẹ̀rẹ̀','Top corner, end side'=>'Igun oke, ẹgbẹ ipari','Top corner, start side'=>'Igun òkè, ìhà ìbẹ̀rẹ̀','Switcher around the content'=>'Oluyipada ni ayika akoonu','Add a switcher to every post and page'=>'Fi oluyipada kun gbogbo ifiweranṣẹ ati oju-iwe','Before the content'=>'Ṣaaju akoonu','After the content'=>'Lẹ́yìn àkóónú','Other ways to add a switcher'=>'Awọn ọna miiran lati fi oluyipada kun','Block editor and site editor: the “Language switcher” block, with five designs.'=>'Olootu bulọọku ati olootu aaye ayelujara: bulọọku "Olupayipada ede", pẹlu awọn apẹrẹ marun.','Page Builder Sandwich: the “Language switcher” element.'=>'Page Builder Sandwich: ẹ̀yà “Olùpààrọ̀ èdè”.','Menus: Appearance → Menus → “Language switcher” box.'=>'Àwọn akojọ: Ìfihàn → Àwọn akojọ → àpótí “Olùpààrọ̀ èdè”.','Sidebars: the “Language switcher” widget.'=>'Àwọn ọ̀pá ẹ̀gbẹ́: wíjẹ́ẹ̀tì "Olùyí èdè padà".','Anywhere else, the shortcode:'=>'Ibikibi miiran, koodu kukuru naa:','Elementor and Bricks: the “Language switcher” widget in each builder.'=>'Elementor àti Bricks: wíjíìtì "Olùyí èdè padà" nínú olùkọ́ kọ̀ọ̀kan.','Elementor and Bricks widgets are part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Àwọn widget Elementor àti Bricks jẹ́ ara Tranzly Pro.','Save'=>'Fipamọ́','A folder per language: example.com/de/'=>'Folda kan fun ede kọọkan: example.com/de/','A subdomain per language: de.example.com'=>'Agbegbe kekere kan fun ede kọọkan: de.example.com','A separate domain per language: example.de'=>'Agbegbe lọtọ fun ede kọọkan: example.de','A query parameter: example.com/?lang=de (older sites)'=>'Pàrámítà ìbéèrè: example.com/?lang=de (àwọn ojúlé àtijọ́)','Category'=>'Ìsọ̀rí','Tag'=>'Ami','Product'=>'Ọjà','Product category'=>'Ẹ̀ka ọjà','Product tag'=>'Aami ọjà','Saved. Your language addresses have changed as shown below.'=>'Ti fi pamọ́. Awọn adirẹsi ede rẹ ti yipada gẹgẹ bi a ti fihan ni isalẹ.','Language in the address'=>'Èdè nínú àdírẹ́ẹ̀sì','How visitors and search engines reach each language'=>'Bí àwọn àlejò àti àwọn ẹ̀rọ ìṣàwárí ṣe ń dé orí èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan','Address word for %s'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ ìpè fún %s','The default language has no word in its addresses.'=>'Èdè àtìbẹ̀rẹ̀ kò ní ọ̀rọ̀ kankan nínú àwọn àdírẹ́sì rẹ̀.','Domain for %s (optional)'=>'Agbegbe fun %s (aṣayan)','Point the domain at this site first. A language with no domain uses a folder on your main domain.'=>'Kọ́kọ́ tọ́ka orúkọ ààyè sí ojúlé yìí. Èdè tí kò ní orúkọ ààyè ń lo àpò ìwé kan lórí orúkọ ààyè àkọ́kọ́ rẹ.','Where each language lives now'=>'Níbi tí èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan wà báyìí','Translated address words'=>'Àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ àdírẹ́ẹ̀sì tí a túmọ̀','Page and post addresses come from their translated titles. Here you translate the fixed words, so /de/kategorie/ replaces /de/category/.'=>'Àwọn àdírẹ́ẹ̀sì ojú-ewé àti àtẹ̀jáde wá láti ara àwọn àkọlé tí a ti túmọ̀ wọn. Níbí ni ẹ ti ń túmọ̀ àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ tí kò yípadà, kí /de/kategorie/ lè rọ́pò /de/category/.','%1$s (now “%2$s”)'=>'%1$s (ní báyìí “%2$s”)','Search engines and visitors'=>'Àwọn ẹ̀rọ ìṣàwárí àti àwọn àlejò','Offer visitors their own language with a small banner (never a redirect)'=>'Pese èdè tiwọn fún àwọn àlejò pẹ̀lú asia kékeré kan (kì í ṣe àtúnjúwe)','Hide untranslated pages from search engines (noindex)'=>'Fi àwọn ojú-ewé tí a kò tíì túmọ̀ pamọ́ fún àwọn ẹ̀rọ ìṣàwárí (noindex)','A translation that still holds the original text is kept out of search results until it is translated.'=>'Ìtúmọ̀ tí ó ṣì ní ọ̀rọ̀ àbùdá nínú ni a ó pa mọ́ kúrò nínú àbájáde àwárí títí tí a ó fi túmọ̀ rẹ̀.','Part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Apá kan ninu Tranzly Pro.','Tranzly adds hreflang links (with x-default), the page language and direction, and every language to your sitemap:'=>'Tranzly máa ń fi àwọn ìsopọ̀ hreflang (pẹ̀lú x-default), èdè àti ìtọ́sọ́nà ojú-ewé, àti gbogbo èdè kún máàpù ojú-òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù rẹ:','Working together with: %s.'=>'Ń ṣiṣẹ́ pọ̀ pẹ̀lú: %s.','Each address word is 2 to 12 lowercase letters, digits or hyphens.'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ àdírẹ́sì kọ̀ọ̀kan ní lẹ́tà kékeré, nọ́mbà tàbí àmì-ìdásí 2 sí 12.','Auto-translate on update, reviewer roles, XLIFF export for translators, switching from WPML, Polylang or TranslatePress and the AI quality check come with Tranzly Pro.'=>'Ìyípadà èdè aládàáṣiṣẹ́ nígbà ìmúdàgbàsókè, àwọn ipa olùṣàtúnyẹ̀wò, ìkójáde XLIFF fún àwọn olùyípadà èdè, yíyípadà láti WPML, Polylang tàbí TranslatePress àti àyẹ̀wò dídára AI wá pẹ̀lú Tranzly Pro.','When an original changes'=>'Nígbàtí àtìbẹ̀rẹ̀ bá yípadà','When a page is edited'=>'Nígbàtí a bá ṣàtúnṣe ojúewé kan','Mark its translations out of date'=>'Sàmìsí àwọn ìtumọ̀ rẹ̀ gẹ́gẹ́ bí èyí tí kò bá ìgbà mu mọ́','Translate its translations again in the background'=>'Túmọ̀ àwọn ìtúmọ̀ rẹ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi ní abẹ́lẹ̀','Do nothing'=>'Má ṣe ohunkóhun','A translation a person edited is never overwritten; it is marked out of date instead.'=>'Ìtúmọ̀ tí ènìyàn ṣàtúnṣe rẹ̀ kì í ṣe àtúnkọ lé lórí láéláé; dípò bẹ́ẹ̀, a máa ń sàmì sí i gẹ́gẹ́ bí èyí tí kò bófin mu mọ́.','Translate new pages into every language when they are published'=>'Ṣe itumọ awọn oju-iwe tuntun si gbogbo ede nigba ti a ba tẹ wọn jade','A second AI model reads each translation beside its original, scores it and names the mistakes. It uses your own AI key from the AI settings. Start a check from Translation status.'=>'Àwòṣe AI kejì kan ń ka ìtumọ̀ kọ̀ọ̀kan lẹ́gbẹ̀ẹ́ ti àbínibí rẹ̀, ó ń fún un ní máàkì ó sì ń dárúkọ àwọn àṣìṣe náà. Ó ń lo kọ́kọ́rọ́ AI tirẹ̀ láti inú àwọn ètò AI. Bẹ̀rẹ̀ àyẹ̀wò kan láti Ipò ìtumọ̀.','AI provider'=>'Olùpèsè AI','The AI settings’ general model'=>'Àwòṣe ìlò gbogbo ti àwọn ètò AI','Recommended'=>'A gbani niyanju','A page needs a human look below this score'=>'Ojú-ìwé kan nílò àyẹ̀wò ẹ̀dá ènìyàn lábẹ́ àmì ayò yìí','Publish only translations a reviewer approved'=>'Tẹ awọn itumọ ti oluyẹwo fọwọsi nikan sita','Give people the Translator role (edits translations, never the originals, cannot publish) or the Translation reviewer role (also approves). Reviewers also find everything waiting in the Posts and Pages lists under “Pending”; publishing one there approves it.'=>'Fun awọn eniyan ni ipa Olutumọ (ṣatunkọ awọn itumọ, kii ṣe awọn atilẹba rara, ko le tẹjade) tabi ipa Oluyẹwo itumọ (tun fọwọsi). Awọn oluyẹwo tun rii ohun gbogbo ti n duro de ninu awọn akojọ Awọn ifiweranṣẹ ati Awọn oju-iwe labẹ "Ni idaduro"; titẹ ọkan jade nibẹ n fọwọsi rẹ.','Manage users'=>'Ṣàkóso àwọn olùlò','Nothing is waiting for review.'=>'Kò sí ohun tó ń dúró de àtúnyẹ̀wò.','Note for the translator (optional)'=>'Àkíyèsí fún olùtúmọ̀ (àṣàyàn)','Read side by side'=>'Kà lẹ́gbẹ̀ẹ́kẹ́gbẹ́','Approve'=>'Fọwọsi','Ask for changes'=>'Béèrè fún àwọn àyípadà','%d translations imported and protected from machine translation.'=>'A ti gbé àwọn ìtumọ̀ %d wọlé, a sì ti dáàbò bò wọ́n kúrò lọ́wọ́ ìtumọ̀ ẹ̀rọ.','Export and import for translators'=>'Ìkójáde àti ìkówalé fún àwọn olùyípadà èdè','Not translated yet'=>'A kò tíì ṣògbufọ̀ rẹ̀','Already translated'=>'Ti ṣe ìtúmọ̀ rẹ̀ tẹ́lẹ̀','Format'=>'Ìrísí','XLIFF 1.2 (translation tools)'=>'XLIFF 1.2 (àwọn irinṣẹ́ ìtúmọ̀)','CSV (spreadsheets)'=>'CSV (àwọn iwé kaakiri)','Download the file'=>'Gba faili naa wọle','Import a translated file'=>'Kó fáìlì tí a ti túmọ̀ wọlé','Undone: %1$d links removed, %2$d imported pages deleted.'=>'Ti da pada: a yọ àwọn àjápọ̀ %1$d kúrò, a pa àwọn ojú-ìwé tí a kó wọle %2$d rẹ́.','Dry run, nothing changed:'=>'Ìgbìyànjú àyẹ̀wò, kò sí ohun tí a yípadà:','Imported:'=>'Ti wọle:','%1$d languages added, %2$d translations linked, %3$d pages built, %4$d texts.'=>'A ṣe àfikún àwọn èdè %1$d, a so àwọn ìyédèpadà %2$d pọ̀, a kọ́ àwọn ojú-ewé %3$d, àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ %4$d.','Switch the other plugin off first (its addresses and switchers would fight Tranzly). Its data stays where it is, so you can switch back; Undo removes exactly what the import added.'=>'Kọ́kọ́ pa afikun-un kọ̀ǹpútà kejì (àwọn àdírẹ́ẹ̀sì àti àwọn olùyípadà rẹ̀ yóò dojúkọ Tranzly). Àwọn dátà rẹ̀ yóò wà níbi tí wọ́n wà, nítorí náà ẹ lè yípadà sẹ́yìn; Ṣíṣe àìṣe ń yọ ohun gangan tí ìgbéwọle fi kún un kúrò.','No data from this plugin on this site.'=>'Kò sí data lati orí àfikún yìí lórí ojúlé yìí.','Languages: %s'=>'Àwọn èdè: %s','still active: switch it off first.'=>'ṣi n ṣiṣẹ: kọkọ pa a.','Dry run'=>'Ìgbìyànjú àbájáde','Import'=>'Kó wọlé','Undo the import'=>'Ṣe àìgbàwọle','Comments and product reviews'=>'Àwọn àwíyé àti àtúnyẹ̀wò ọjà','Each language keeps its own'=>'Èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan ń tọ́jú ti ara rẹ̀','Show every language’s comments on every version'=>'Ṣe afihan awọn asọye gbogbo ede lori gbogbo ẹya','Show them all, translated into the reader’s language'=>'Ṣe afihan gbogbo wọn, ti a tumọ si ede oluka','Translating uses your translation engine for every approved comment. Spam and comments waiting for moderation are never sent.'=>'Itumọ nlo ẹrọ itumọ rẹ fun gbogbo ọrọ asọye ti a fọwọsi. A kii fi awọn àwọn ifiranṣẹ aifẹ ati awọn asọye ti n duro de iṣakoso ranṣẹ rara.','Saved. The pieces you changed are marked as checked by a person, and this translation is protected from machine translation.'=>'Ti fipamọ́. Àwọn ẹ̀yà tí ẹ yípadà ni a ti sàmì sí gẹ́gẹ́ bí èyí tí ènìyàn ti yẹ̀wò, a sì dáàbò bo ìyípadà èdè yìí kúrò lọ́wọ́ ìyípadà èdè ẹ̀rọ.','The layout of this translation was changed in the editor, so some pieces no longer pair with the original. Pieces without a partner are shown empty; edit the rest in the editor.'=>'A yí ìrísí ìtúmọ̀ yìí padà nínú olóòtú, nítorí náà àwọn apá kan kò bá ti àbínibí mu mọ́. Àwọn apá tí kò ní alábàáṣiṣẹpọ̀ ni a fi hàn ní òfo; ṣàtúnṣe àwọn tó kù nínú olóòtú.','Open the editor'=>'Ṣí olóòtú náà','Original (%s)'=>'Atilẹba (%s)','Translation (%s)'=>'Ìtumọ̀ (%s)','This piece has formatting or links, so it is shown with its HTML. Change only the words between the tags.'=>'Apá yìí ní ìtòlẹ́sẹẹsẹ tàbí àwọn àjápọ̀ nínú, nítorí náà a fi hàn pẹ̀lú HTML rẹ̀. Yí àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ tí ó wà láàárín àwọn àmì nìkan padà.','Save changes'=>'Fi àwọn àyípadà pamọ́','Open in the editor'=>'Ṣí ninu olootu','Checked by a person'=>'Yẹ̀wò nípasẹ̀ ẹnìkan','Imported'=>'Ti wọle','Not in the translation'=>'Kò sí nínú ìtúmọ̀','Add a second language under Tranzly in the admin menu, and the switcher appears here.'=>'Ṣafikun ede keji labẹ Tranzly ninu akojọ aṣayan alabojuto, oluyipada naa yoo si han nibi.','Off by default: a flag is a country, not a language.'=>'A pa á gẹ́gẹ́ bí àtìbẹ̀rẹ̀: àsíá jẹ́ orílẹ̀-èdè, kì í ṣe èdè.','What screen readers announce, for example “Choose a language”.'=>'Ohun tí àwọn olùkà ojú-ìbòjú ń kéde, fún àpẹẹrẹ “Yan èdè kan”.','Colours'=>'Àwọn Àwọ̀','Not translated'=>'A ko tumọ rẹ','Original'=>'Atilẹba','Published'=>'Agbéjade','Draft'=>'Àkọsílẹ̀ àkọ́kọ́','Checked by a person, protected'=>'Ṣayẹwo nipasẹ eniyan kan, ni aabo','Imported, protected'=>'Ti wọle, ti ni aabo','Not translated yet (a copy)'=>'A kò tíì ṣetúmọ̀ rẹ̀ (ẹ̀dà kan)','View'=>'Wo','Unlock so it can be translated again'=>'Ṣíi sílẹ̀ kí a lè tún un túmọ̀','Protect'=>'Dàbòbò','Publish the translations'=>'Ṣe àtẹ̀jáde àwọn ìyípadà èdè','Translate into %d language'=>'Ṣe ògbufọ̀ sí èdè %d','Show this block'=>'Ṣe afihan bulọọki yii','In every language'=>'Ní gbogbo èdè','Only in the languages ticked'=>'Nínú àwọn èdè tí a sàmì sí nìkan','In every language except those ticked'=>'Ní gbogbo èdè àyàfi àwọn tí a sàmì sí','AI agents are allowed. Reload this page to see the tools.'=>'A gba awọn aṣoju AI laaye. Tun oju-iwe yii gbe lati wo awọn irinṣẹ.','AI agents are turned off. Their connection address no longer answers.'=>'A ti pa àwọn aṣojú AI. Àdírẹ́ẹ̀sì ìsopọ̀ wọn kò dáhùn mọ́.','Image per language'=>'Àwòrán fún èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan','Show another image to readers of a language, for example a banner with words on it.'=>'Fi àwòrán mìíràn han àwọn olùkà èdè kan, fún àpẹẹrẹ asia tí ó ní àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ lórí rẹ̀.','Replace the %s image'=>'Rọ́pò àwòrán %s','Choose a %s image'=>'Yan àwòrán %s kan','Use the original image'=>'Lo àwòrán àtìbẹ̀rẹ̀','%1$s: %2$s'=>'%1$s: %2$s','The AI settings\' choice (%1$s %2$s)'=>'Aṣayan awọn eto AI (%1$s %2$s)','The AI settings\' choice'=>'Aṣayan awọn eto AI','Choose the AI model that translates each language, for example one model for Japanese and another for German. Languages without a choice of their own use the model for all other languages.'=>'Yan àwòṣe AI tí yóò túmọ̀ èdè kọ̀ọ̀kan, fún àpẹẹrẹ àwòṣe kan fún èdè Japanese àti òmíràn fún èdè German. Àwọn èdè tí kò bá ní àṣàyàn tiwọn yóò lo àwòṣe fún gbogbo àwọn èdè yòókù.','AI model for all other languages'=>'Awoṣe AI fun gbogbo awọn ede miiran','Engine for %s'=>'Ẹnjini fun %s','The default engine'=>'Ẹnjini aiyipada','AI model for %s'=>'Awoṣe AI fun %s','The model for all other languages'=>'Àwòṣe fún gbogbo àwọn èdè yòókù','If an engine fails or reaches a limit, try these next, in this order'=>'Ti ẹnjini kan ba kuna tabi ti o ba de opin, gbiyanju awọn wọnyi lẹhinna, ni ilana yii','Monthly spending caps'=>'Àwọn ààlà ìnáwó oṣooṣù','When an engine reaches its cap, nothing more is sent to it until next month and the failed-translation report says why. Leave empty for no cap.'=>'Nígbà tí ẹ̀rọ kan bá dé òpin àyè rẹ̀, kò sí ohun mìíràn tí a ó fi ránṣẹ́ sí i mọ́ títí di oṣù tí ń bọ̀ bẹ́ẹ̀ sì ni ìròyìn ìyípadà èdè tí kò yọrí sí rere yóò sọ ìdí rẹ̀. Fi sílẹ̀ ní òfo fún àìní òpin.','%1$s (spent this month: $%2$s)'=>'%1$s (inawo oṣù yi: $%2$s)','AI provider %1$s, every language it translates (spent this month: $%2$s)'=>'Olupese AI %1$s, gbogbo èdè tí ó túmọ̀ (ó ti ná ní oṣù yìí: $%2$s)','Save spending caps'=>'Fipamọ́ àwọn ààlà ìnáwó','Preferred translations (one per line: term = translation)'=>'Àwọn ìyípadà èdè tí a fẹ́ràn jù (ọ̀kọ̀ọ̀kan lórí ìlà: ọ̀rọ̀ = ìyípadà èdè)','Formality'=>'Ìṣe-gẹ́gẹ́-bí-òfin','Default'=>'Aiyipada','Formal'=>'Óṣìṣẹ́','Informal'=>'Aifowonilẹ','Style instructions (audience, brand voice)'=>'Awọn itọnisọna ara (olugbọ, ohùn aami-iṣowo)','Correct this translation'=>'Ṣatunṣe itumọ yii','Saving…'=>'Ń fi pamọ́…','Translated text. Press Enter to correct it.'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀ tí a túmọ̀. Tẹ Enter láti tún un ṣe.','Click any outlined text to correct its translation.'=>'Tẹ ọ̀rọ̀ eyikeyi ti a ṣe ilana lati ṣe atunṣe itumọ rẹ.','No translated text was found on this page to edit here. Use the side-by-side editor instead.'=>'A kò rí ọ̀rọ̀ tí a túmọ̀ lórí ojú-ewé yìí láti ṣàtúnṣe níbí. Lo olóòtú ẹ̀gbẹ́-sí-ẹ̀gbẹ́ dípò rẹ̀.','block titleLanguage switcher'=>'Olùyí èdè padà','block descriptionLinks to this page in each of the site\'s languages. It renders nothing until two or more languages are listed.'=>'Awọn ọna asopọ si oju-iwe yii ni ede kọọkan ti aaye naa. Ko ṣe afihan ohunkohun titi ti a fi ṣe akojọ awọn ede meji tabi ju bẹẹ lọ.','block keywordlanguage'=>'Èdè','block keywordswitcher'=>'Olùyípadà','block keywordtranslation'=>'Ìtumọ̀','block descriptionLets visitors read this page in another of your languages: a list, pills, buttons, a dropdown or language codes, with optional flags.'=>'Gba awọn alejo laaye lati ka oju-iwe yii ni ede miiran ti tirẹ: atokọ kan, awọn egbogi, awọn bọtini, akojọ aṣayan silẹ tabi awọn koodu ede, pẹlu awọn asia aṣayan.','block keywordmultilingual'=>'Onírúurú èdè','Tranzly™'=>'Tranzly™']];